标杆往前推了一步，MiniMax 就带着实名的“太空兔”追来了。</span></p><section nodeleaf="" style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><img  class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-aistatus="1" data-backh="410" data-backw="546" data-croporisrc="https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/XqAicMdcoiafPCV2LGpnDdaXrfp7Fe1kopniaxp15V1fr7vS0grTFRnUAh4sCMxX6GNEGVCwiaDLOLzUv838icV7I5hwEGUpOuLfayzmwfm6ia224/0?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg" data-cropselx1="0" data-cropselx2="546" data-cropsely1="0" data-cropsely2="410" data-imgfileid="100263833" data-ratio="0.75" data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261021/6ad83963aa579.jpg" data-type="gif" data-w="800" style="width:100%;"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261021/6ad83963aa579.jpg?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><p style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">10 月 17 日，被网友戏称为“大肥鱼”的DeepSeek 更新 V4.1 Flash-1017；仅隔两天，MiniMax 正式发布 M3.1 Flash，并认领了此前在开发者社区颇受关注的匿名模型 Space Bunny。两款国产 Flash 前后脚亮相，网友已经开始拿“大肥鱼”和“太空兔”开起了玩笑。</span></p><section nodeleaf="" style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261021/6ad83963c6b91.png" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="0.2371967654986523" data-type="png" data-w="371" style="width:100%;" data-width="371" data-height="88" data-backw="371" data-backh="88" data-imgfileid="100263818" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261021/6ad83963c6b91.png?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><p style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">不过，这次 MiniMax 还真不只是来拼价格的。</span></p><p style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">根据此次公布的模型评测数据，</span><strong style="font-weight: bold;text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><span leaf="" style="font-weight: bold;text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="color: #4499E7;">M3.1 Flash 在 Automation-Bench 复杂 Agent 任务对比中位居第一，BankerToolBench 与 Opus 5 并列第一，Coding 性价比则仅次于 DeepSeek。</span></span></strong><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">&nbsp;两款国产 Flash 前后脚更新，一个在软件工程上保持领先，一个在复杂 Agent 任务中拿出了更好的成绩。</span></p><section nodeleaf="" style="text-align: center;margin: 16px 16px 0px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span textstyle="" style="color: #888888;"><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261021/6ad839640e7be.png" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="0.71640625" data-type="png" data-w="1280" style="width: 100%;" data-width="1280" data-height="917" data-backw="546" data-backh="391" data-imgfileid="100263821" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261021/6ad839640e7be.png?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></span></section><p style="text-align: center;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="color: #888888;">在 Automation-Bench 数据集上，M3.1 Flash 的任务费用分布性价比最高</span></span></p><p style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">我们也拿 M3.1 Flash 跑了一道实际任务：给模型一张手绘平面图和建筑尺寸表，让它从零建出一座可以在浏览器里交互的 3D 校园。</span></p><section nodeleaf="" style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261021/6ad839644ba56.png" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="0.4485294117647059" data-type="png" data-w="816" style="width:100%;" data-width="816" data-height="366" data-backw="546" data-backh="245" data-imgfileid="100263820" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261021/6ad839644ba56.png?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><p style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">结果上两套方案都完成了主要交付要求，但 MiniMax Code＋M3.1 Flash 用时&nbsp;</span><strong style="font-weight: bold;text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><span leaf="" style="font-weight: bold;text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="color: #4499E7;">55.4 分钟</span></span></strong><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">，OpenCode＋DeepSeek V4.1 Flash 则花了</span><strong style="font-weight: bold;text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><span leaf="" style="font-weight: bold;text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="color: #4499E7;">约 121 分钟</span></span></strong><span leaf="" style="font-weight: bold;text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="color: #4499E7;">。</span></span><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">按照本次测试采用的 API 计价口径折算，两边的模型费用都在 6.5 元左右。</span></p><p style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><strong><span leaf="" style="font-weight: bold;text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="color: #4499E7;">同样是几块钱的模型费用，MiniMax 却少花了约 65 分钟。</span></span></strong></p><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mvgtoeemlcc"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mba8mvlk1t2b"><section style="width: 100%;display: flex;justify-content: center;align-items: center;padding: 0px 14px 0px 14px;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section style="display: flex;justify-content: flex-start;align-items: center;flex-direction: column;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section nodeleaf="" style="width: 38px;height: 38px;display: flex;justify-content: center;align-items: center;margin-bottom: -38px;margin-left: -20px;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261021/6ad83964836a8.jpg" alt="图片" class="rich_pages wxw-img __bg_gif" data-ratio="1.0075757575757576" data-type="gif" data-w="132" style="display: block;height: auto !important;visibility: visible !important;width: 38px !important;background-color: transparent;" data-imgfileid="100241584" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261021/6ad83964836a8.jpg?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><section style="text-align: center;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><p style="font-size: 36px;color: #333333;line-height: 50px;" data-mid=""><strong mpa-none-content="t" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><span leaf="">01</span><span leaf=""><br/></span></strong></p><h2 data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><span leaf=""><br/></span><strong mpa-none-content="t" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><strong style="justify-content: flex-start;align-items: center;flex-direction: column;text-align: center;font-size: 18px;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);line-height: 25px;font-weight: bold;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;" mpa-from-tpl="t"><strong style="justify-content: flex-start;align-items: center;flex-direction: column;text-align: center;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);line-height: 25px;font-weight: bold;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size: 18px;" mpa-from-tpl="t"><span leaf="">太空兔亮明身份，</span></strong></strong></strong></h2></section><section style="text-align: center;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><h2 data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><strong mpa-none-content="t" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><strong style="justify-content: flex-start;align-items: center;flex-direction: column;text-align: center;font-size: 18px;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);line-height: 25px;font-weight: bold;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;" mpa-from-tpl="t"><strong style="justify-content: flex-start;align-items: center;flex-direction: column;text-align: center;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);line-height: 25px;font-weight: bold;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size: 18px;" mpa-from-tpl="t"><span leaf="">MiniMax 这次强在哪儿？</span><span leaf=""><br/></span></strong></strong></strong></h2></section></section></section></section></section><p style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">在正式亮明身份之前，Space Bunny 已经在开发者社区跑出了一些存在感。</span></p><p style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">OpenRouter 披露，它曾连续 10 天占据平台模型使用量榜首，累计处理 56.7T Token。MiniMax 此次也确认，这款匿名模型在相关测试及使用期间累计处理量超过 200T Token。</span><strong style="font-weight: bold;text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><span leaf="" style="font-weight: bold;text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="color: #4499E7;">速度快，</span></span></strong><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">是不少开发者此前对它的印象。</span></p><p style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">开发者 Hassan 还在 X 上晒出了一组很直观的对比：他让 M3.1 Flash 和 Claude Opus 5.5 分别制作一款硬件产品的发布落地页，MiniMax 交出的设计让他相当满意，而两边的账单分别只有 0.014 美元和 1.22 美元。在他的这次测试中，MiniMax 的完成速度还快了约 4 倍。</span></p><section nodeleaf="" style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261021/6ad83964a9a2f.jpg" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="1.3430749682337992" data-type="png" data-w="787" style="width:542px;height:729px;" data-width="792" data-height="1057" data-croporisrc="https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/XqAicMdcoiafNrSyZqPa0f9EVibKpC18PKWl9NUy2jicQscdKiaX3up2rTdCicFXcVpYAFqicGURa6kib721A7K3xAQVM3GNOFDKicPE28QDGia2wQvs0/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg" data-cropx1="5.802197802197802" data-cropx2="792" data-cropy1="0" data-cropy2="1057.4505494505495" data-backw="546" data-backh="729" data-imgfileid="100263822" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261021/6ad83964a9a2f.jpg?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><p style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">当然，单次开发者测试不能代表模型的整体水平。不过 MiniMax 这次值得关注的，还包括正式发布后拿出的榜单成绩。</span></p><p style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">截至 10 月 20 日，在 Artificial Analysis（AA）榜单中，M3.1 Flash 的智能指数达到 43 分，上一代 M3 则为 29 分，提升接近五成。与此同时，其任务加权平均模型费用从 0.51 美元降至 0.22 美元。</span><strong style="font-weight: bold;text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><span leaf="" style="font-weight: bold;text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="color: #4499E7;">也就是说，分数涨了，完成任务的成本反而降了一半还多。</span></span></strong></p><section nodeleaf="" style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 0px;line-height: 1.75em;"><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261021/6ad83964d9dd5.png" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="0.3828125" data-type="png" data-w="1280" style="width: 100%;" data-width="1280" data-height="490" data-backw="546" data-backh="209" data-imgfileid="100263823" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261021/6ad83964d9dd5.png?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><p style="text-align: center;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="color: #888888;">M3.1 Flash 在 AA 榜单获得 43 分，名列全球模型前列</span></span></p><p style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">不过，真要和两天前刚更新的 DeepSeek V4.1 Flash-1017 掰掰手腕，两款模型倒是各有胜负。</span></p><p style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">在软件工程基准 DeepSWE v1.1 中，DeepSeek 取得 77.0%，M3.1 Flash 为 73.7%。虽然仍有差距，但后者已经与 Opus 5（74.0%）、GPT-5.6 Sol（73.0%）处于接近的成绩区间。按照此次公布的 Coding 性价比对比，DeepSeek 位居第一，MiniMax 紧随其后。</span></p><p style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><strong style="font-weight: bold;text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><span leaf="" style="font-weight: bold;text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="color: #4499E7;">但换到 MiniMax 这次主攻的复杂 Agent 任务，情况就反过来了。</span></span></strong><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">&nbsp;在此次发布的 Automation-Bench v1.0.6 模型对比中，M3.1 Flash 超过 DeepSeek，位列第一；BankerToolBench 则拿到了 76.2%，与 Opus 5 并列第一。此外，它在网络安全基准 CyberGym 上也取得了 82.2% 的成绩。</span></p><section nodeleaf="" style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 0px;line-height: 1.75em;"><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261021/6ad839651e340.png" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="0.7484375" data-type="png" data-w="1280" style="width: 100%;" data-width="1280" data-height="958" data-backw="546" data-backh="409" data-imgfileid="100263825" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261021/6ad839651e340.png?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><p style="text-align: center;margin: 0px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="color: #888888;">图：评测榜单数据</span></span></p><p style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">Automation-Bench 的测试内容也比较贴近实际工作。它由 SaaS 自动化平台 Zapier 构建，包含 600 个真实企业业务流程任务，覆盖销售、营销、运营、客服、财务及 HR 等场景。比起单纯生成一段代码，这类任务更考验模型能不能在不同系统之间连续调用工具，把一件事从头到尾办完。BankerToolBench 则将场景换成了金融业务，对多步骤规划、跨文档信息处理和工具调用提出了更高要求。</span></p><p style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">这么看，DeepSeek 和 MiniMax 也不必急着分出一个总冠军。</span><strong style="font-weight: bold;text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><span leaf="" style="font-weight: bold;text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="color: #4499E7;">Coding 这边，DeepSeek 仍有优势；复杂 Agent 任务上，MiniMax 则扳回了一局。</span></span></strong><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">&nbsp;对于开发者来说，国产 Flash 又多了一个能打的选择。</span></p><p style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">更重要的是，这次成绩提升之外，M3.1 Flash 每百万 Token 输入 1 元、输出 4 元、缓存读取仅 0.1 元。相比上一代 M3，输入和输出价格约降低一半，缓存读取价格下降约 75%；与 DeepSeek V4.1 Flash-1017 相比，其输入、输出价格相当于后者高峰期的一半，与空闲时段持平，而且全天不区分峰谷。</span></p><section nodeleaf="" style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261021/6ad839654066c.jpg" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="0.37314906219151034" data-type="png" data-w="1013" style="width:512px;height:191px;" data-width="1280" data-height="520" data-croporisrc="https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/XqAicMdcoiafM9hibIOdrRIVstLb1wjckAiaLIeEN85vHaZTXkurF7ccgWZlJzSKpUAox65eswxcBDfseyLibFFZW6sibz9K46MpgKbNCDR84dVwM/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg" data-cropx1="31.64835164835165" data-cropx2="1044.3956043956046" data-cropy1="29.67032967032967" data-cropy2="407.4725274725275" data-backw="546" data-backh="222" data-imgfileid="100263824" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261021/6ad839654066c.jpg?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><p style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">价格公布后，评论区已经有人拿 DeepSeek 开起了玩笑：“MiniMax 最讲的就是性价比啊，这个价格还要什么大肥鱼啊是不是。”</span></p><p style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">也有老用户的评价更直接：“不说有多强吧，至少掉队了这么久，现在终于也算跟得上时代了。”</span></p><section nodeleaf="" style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261021/6ad839657f40c.png" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="0.7235621521335807" data-type="png" data-w="1078" style="width:100%;" data-width="1078" data-height="780" data-backw="546" data-backh="395" data-imgfileid="100263826" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261021/6ad839657f40c.png?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><p style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">玩笑归玩笑，这两种声音倒是挺能说明 MiniMax 这次的处境。过去外界谈起它的文本模型，价格往往比能力更容易成为话题，而 M3.1 Flash 这次至少有了一份能够与主流模型正面比较的成绩单。</span><strong style="font-weight: bold;text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><span leaf="" style="font-weight: bold;text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="color: #4499E7;">低价不再是唯一卖点，MiniMax 终于有机会让开发者同时讨论它的能力和性价比。</span></span></strong></p><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mvgtp7an2109"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mba8mvlk1t2b"><section style="width: 100%;display: flex;justify-content: center;align-items: center;padding: 0px 14px 0px 14px;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section style="display: flex;justify-content: flex-start;align-items: center;flex-direction: column;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section nodeleaf="" style="width: 38px;height: 38px;display: flex;justify-content: center;align-items: center;margin-bottom: -38px;margin-left: -20px;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261021/6ad83965b5fb3.jpg" alt="图片" class="rich_pages wxw-img __bg_gif" data-ratio="1.0075757575757576" data-type="gif" data-w="132" style="display: block;height: auto !important;visibility: visible !important;width: 38px !important;background-color: transparent;" data-imgfileid="100241584" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261021/6ad83965b5fb3.jpg?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><section style="text-align: center;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><p style="font-size: 36px;color: #333333;line-height: 50px;" data-mid=""><strong mpa-none-content="t" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><span leaf="">02</span><span leaf=""><br/></span></strong></p><h2 data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><span leaf=""><br/></span><strong mpa-none-content="t" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><strong style="justify-content: flex-start;align-items: center;flex-direction: column;text-align: center;font-size: 18px;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);line-height: 25px;font-weight: bold;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;" mpa-from-tpl="t"><strong style="justify-content: flex-start;align-items: center;flex-direction: column;text-align: center;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);line-height: 25px;font-weight: bold;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size: 18px;" mpa-from-tpl="t"><span leaf="">实测：同样做一座3D校园，</span></strong></strong></strong></h2></section><section style="text-align: center;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><h2 data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><strong mpa-none-content="t" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><strong style="justify-content: flex-start;align-items: center;flex-direction: column;text-align: center;font-size: 18px;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);line-height: 25px;font-weight: bold;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;" mpa-from-tpl="t"><strong style="justify-content: flex-start;align-items: center;flex-direction: column;text-align: center;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);line-height: 25px;font-weight: bold;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size: 18px;" mpa-from-tpl="t"><span leaf="">MiniMax少花了65分钟</span><span leaf=""><br/></span></strong></strong></strong></h2></section></section></section></section></section><p style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">榜单上两款 Flash 各有胜负，我们也给它们安排了同一道实际任务：根据一张手绘校园平面图和建筑尺寸表，从零搭建一座可以在浏览器里交互的3D校园。</span></p><p style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">题目提供的材料是一张手绘校园平面图和一份建筑尺寸表，要求完成校园布局与冲突检查，编写 Blender 脚本建模，保留可编辑源文件并导出 GLB，再用 Three.js 做成可交互网页，支持建筑选择、详情查看、镜头定位和模拟时间。</span></p><blockquote><p style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">测试分别采用</span><strong><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">&nbsp;MiniMax Code＋M3.1 Flash 与 OpenCode＋DeepSeek V4.1 Flash</span></strong><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">，在同一本地环境运行。</span></p></blockquote><section nodeleaf="" style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261021/6ad8396635d92.png" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="0.7027777777777777" data-type="png" data-w="1080" style="width:100%;" data-width="1080" data-height="759" data-backw="546" data-backh="384" data-imgfileid="100263827" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261021/6ad8396635d92.png?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><section nodeleaf="" style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 0px;line-height: 1.75em;"><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261021/6ad839665da6a.png" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="0.3375" data-type="png" data-w="1280" style="width: 100%;" data-width="1280" data-height="432" data-backw="546" data-backh="184" data-imgfileid="100263828" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261021/6ad839665da6a.png?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><p style="text-align: center;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="color: #888888;">校园手绘平面图和建筑物尺寸数据表</span></span></p><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mvgtrfcr5sv"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mqggjy08r8x" data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><p style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span style="font-family:等线"><strong mpa-from-tpl="t"><span leaf="" data-pm-slice="1 1 [&quot;heading&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;h3&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;text-align: justify; margin: 16px 16px 24px; line-height: 1.75em;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;,&quot;level&quot;:3}]"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 1px;color: #4499E7;font-weight: bold;">▎</span></span><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 1px;color: #4499E7;font-weight: bold;">两边都交了卷，MiniMax 的交互细节更丰富</span></span></strong></span></p></section></section><p style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">先看交付效果，两套方案都完成了主要要求，但页面的呈现方式有所不同。</span></p><p style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">DeepSeek 更偏向建筑数据展示，通过左侧列表、右侧详情面板和底部时间滑块组织信息；MiniMax 则将建筑编号、场地信息和视角切换放在了更醒目的位置，点击建筑后，还有橙色高亮轮廓与浮动标签配合，场景和建筑数据的对应关系更加直观。</span></p><p style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">两边均保留了可编辑的源文件，导出的 GLB 模型也通过了六个建筑编号的核验。就这次任务而言，两套方案都交出了能够运行、后续还能继续修改的项目。</span></p><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mvgtroxdgvt"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mqggjy08r8x" data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><p style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span style="font-family:等线"><strong mpa-from-tpl="t"><span leaf="" data-pm-slice="1 1 [&quot;heading&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;h3&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;text-align: justify; margin: 16px 16px 24px; line-height: 1.75em;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;,&quot;level&quot;:3}]"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 1px;color: #4499E7;font-weight: bold;">▎</span></span><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 1px;color: #4499E7;font-weight: bold;">同样约6.5元，MiniMax提前一小时交卷</span></span></strong></span></p></section></section><p style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><strong><span leaf="" style="font-weight: bold;text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="color: #4499E7;">真正拉开差距的是时间。</span></span></strong></p><p style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">根据本地会话统计，MiniMax组合用时55.4分钟，DeepSeek组合则花了约121分钟。前者少用了约65分钟，会话时长缩短54%。</span></p><p style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">两边的模型账单几乎没有差别。按照10月20日核验的官方API价格折算，MiniMax本次任务的模型费用约为6.50元，DeepSeek按高峰价格计算约为6.52元。MiniMax此次运行的缓存命中率达到98.1%，也帮助它将连续多轮调用的费用控制在较低水平。</span></p><section nodeleaf="" style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 0px;line-height: 1.75em;"><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261021/6ad83966a1097.png" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="0.75" data-type="png" data-w="1448" style="width:100%;" data-width="1448" data-height="1086" data-backw="546" data-backh="410" data-imgfileid="100263830" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261021/6ad83966a1097.png?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><p style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><strong style="font-weight: bold;text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><span leaf="" style="font-weight: bold;text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="color: #4499E7;">在主要交付要求均已完成、模型费用接近的情况下，MiniMax 用不到一小时完成了 DeepSeek 组合花费约两小时的工作。</span></span></strong><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">&nbsp;对需要连续调用工具、反复修改代码的 Agent 来说，少等一个小时，本身就是相当实际的优势。</span></p><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mvgts2tv1mz3"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mba8mvlk1t2b"><section style="width: 100%;display: flex;justify-content: center;align-items: center;padding: 0px 14px 0px 14px;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section style="display: flex;justify-content: flex-start;align-items: center;flex-direction: column;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section nodeleaf="" style="width: 38px;height: 38px;display: flex;justify-content: center;align-items: center;margin-bottom: -38px;margin-left: -20px;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261021/6ad83966d23a9.jpg" alt="图片" class="rich_pages wxw-img __bg_gif" data-ratio="1.0075757575757576" data-type="gif" data-w="132" style="display: block;height: auto !important;visibility: visible !important;width: 38px !important;background-color: transparent;" data-imgfileid="100241584" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261021/6ad83966d23a9.jpg?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><section style="text-align: center;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><p style="font-size: 36px;color: #333333;line-height: 50px;" data-mid=""><strong mpa-none-content="t" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><span leaf="">03</span><span leaf=""><br/></span></strong></p><h2 data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><span leaf=""><br/></span><strong mpa-none-content="t" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><strong style="justify-content: flex-start;align-items: center;flex-direction: column;text-align: center;font-size: 18px;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);line-height: 25px;font-weight: bold;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;" mpa-from-tpl="t"><strong style="justify-content: flex-start;align-items: center;flex-direction: column;text-align: center;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);line-height: 25px;font-weight: bold;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size: 18px;" mpa-from-tpl="t"><span leaf="">&nbsp; Flash 开始抢旗舰的生意，</span></strong></strong></strong></h2></section><section style="text-align: center;" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><h2 data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><strong mpa-none-content="t" data-mid="" mpa-from-tpl="t"><strong style="justify-content: flex-start;align-items: center;flex-direction: column;text-align: center;font-size: 18px;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);line-height: 25px;font-weight: bold;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;" mpa-from-tpl="t"><strong style="justify-content: flex-start;align-items: center;flex-direction: column;text-align: center;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);line-height: 25px;font-weight: bold;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size: 18px;" mpa-from-tpl="t"><span leaf="">价格战卷向任务成本</span><span leaf=""><br/></span></strong></strong></strong></h2></section></section></section></section></section><p style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">过去，Flash 更多被当作旗舰模型的便宜替代品。</span></p><p style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">预算有限、任务简单，开发者才会优先考虑 Flash；遇到复杂的软件工程或多步骤任务，还是习惯交给能力更强的旗舰。但随着 DeepSeek 和 MiniMax 接连更新，这种选择开始有了变化。</span></p><p style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">尤其到了 Agent 场景，模型需要反复读取文件、调用工具、修改代码、处理报错。一项任务可能持续几十分钟甚至数小时，开发者要关注的是</span><strong style="font-weight: bold;text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><span leaf="" style="font-weight: bold;text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="color: #4499E7;">整项工作究竟需要多少时间、多少成本才能完成。</span></span></strong></p><p style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">MiniMax 此次公布的 ALE 成本对比，就提供了一个直观的例子。</span></p><p style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">在 ALE-v1 Overall 完整集的 152 项任务中，M3.1 Flash 通过率为 29.6%，整套评测的估算模型费用约 739 元；通过率相近的 GPT-5.6 Sol（约 30.6%），对应费用则在 5000 元左右。</span></p><section nodeleaf="" style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 0px;line-height: 1.75em;"><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261021/6ad8396719b1e.png" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="0.75" data-type="png" data-w="1280" style="width: 100%;" data-width="1280" data-height="960" data-backw="546" data-backh="410" data-imgfileid="100263829" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261021/6ad8396719b1e.png?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><p style="text-align: center;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;" mpa-font-style="mvgtstsb24ax" data-mpa-action-id="mvgtstsm1yk7" data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><span textstyle="" style="color: #888888;">ALE</span></span><span leaf="" style="text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;" mpa-font-style="mvgtstsb24ax" data-mpa-action-id="mvgtstsm1yk7" data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><span textstyle="" style="color: #888888;">&nbsp;成本图</span></span></p><p style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">两者在这项评测中的完成率只相差约 1 个百分点，模型费用却相差近 7 倍。</span></p><p style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">当然，29.6% 的通过率也说明，M3.1 Flash 还远没到可以全面取代旗舰的程度，真正投入使用时，仍然需要把失败重试和人工检查算进成本。但对于一部分复杂任务，开发者已经有理由先试试 Flash，而不是一上来就调用价格最高的模型。</span></p><p style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">MiniMax 后续还会推出追求更高智能上限的 Pro 版本。而 Flash 对旗舰的冲击也正在显现：</span><strong style="font-weight: bold;text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><span leaf="" style="font-weight: bold;text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="color: #4499E7;">过去需要调用旗舰的工作，现在有一部分已经可以交给价格更低的 Flash 来完成。(雷峰网)</span></span></strong></p><section><span data-lark-record-format="docx/record"></span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;" nodeleaf=""><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261021/6ad8396737836.jpg" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="0.40816326530612246" data-s="300,640" data-type="jpeg" data-w="735" style="width:100%;" data-croporisrc="https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/XqAicMdcoiafMmnFSDYgj5YhRXtSaLUgkFfgfXB8OUWWYPiaDoxH8mK5zicDayMtrjMFic3IP9xClxEvsI2ZkLPt1F4RBmAPwxgaTzUjZQqxdg3Y/0?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg" data-cropselx1="0" data-cropselx2="546" data-cropsely1="0" data-cropsely2="223" data-imgfileid="100254959" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261021/6ad8396737836.jpg?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><section><span data-mpa-action-id="mipr37w01zjd"></span></section>]]></description>
<category>人工智能开发者</category>
<comments>https://www.leiphone.com/category/yanxishe/IMOE7FfuhC0qGxZk.html#comments</comments>
<pubDate>Wed, 21 Oct 2026 12:09:00 +0800</pubDate>
</item>
<item>
<title>不做提分工具，CapaLeap在AI教育焦虑中找「15度夹角」</title>
<link>https://www.leiphone.com/category/weiwu/2pumQSfiTnvcy26r.html</link>
<description><![CDATA[<section data-mpa-powered-by="yiban.io" data-pm-slice="0 0 []" style="-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px 0px 24px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family: &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;"><section style="-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;"><section style="-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;"><section style="-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;" data-mpa-action-id="mr4k8p3w210p" data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><section style="text-align: center;" nodeleaf=""><img src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261021/6ad82a8f481b6.jpg?imageView2/2/w/740"/></section><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-from-tpl="t" style="-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;letter-spacing: 0.544px;visibility: visible;" data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" style="-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px 0px -10px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);letter-spacing: 0px;text-align: right;line-height: 25.6px;visibility: visible;"></section></section><section style="margin-top: 16px;"><section data-mpa-action-id="mv7v9iz4p6w" data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;margin-top: 24px;"><span leaf="" mpa-font-style="mv7v9iytl9n" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">一个六岁的孩子问AI“为什么天是蓝的”。三秒钟，“瑞利散射”的解释弹了出来，精确、流畅、挑不出毛病。</span></span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" mpa-font-style="mv7v9iyta1l" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">孩子听完，点了点头，问了下一个问题。</span></span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" mpa-font-style="mv7v9iyt1jlf" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">答案拿到了。但自己仰头看天、追问为什么早晚颜色不一样、在脑子里慢慢搭出因果链条的过程，被跳过了。</span></span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" mpa-font-style="mv7v9iyti4d" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">这不是个例。中国青少年研究中心2025年对7省（市）8563名中小学生的调查显示，AI总体使用率61.7%，71.0%用它辅助完成作业，21.5%表示“只想和AI聊天，不想和真人聊天”。孩子的自述之外，家长的观察同样直接：中国青年报社对1336名家长的调查中，58.8%觉察到孩子对AI产生心理依赖，42.7%感到其独立思考能力在下降。</span></span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" mpa-font-style="mv7v9iyt574" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">OECD在《2026年数字教育展望》中提出“元认知懒惰”：把认知任务外包给通用聊天机器人，会制造“知识掌握”的假象，学生看似学会了，大脑却从未真正参与加工。</span></span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" mpa-font-style="mv7v9iyt2r4" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">麻省理工学院媒体实验室对54名参与者的脑电图实验发现，使用ChatGPT写作的一组神经连接强度显著低于自主思考组；撤掉工具后，其α波与β波网络仍明显“参与不足”。</span></span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" mpa-font-style="mv7v9iytd1d" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">担忧归担忧，行为的惯性并没有因此停下。当越来越多AI产品争着替孩子“秒回答案”时，也有公司选择不同方向。</span></span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" mpa-font-style="mv7v9iytjfv" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">噜咔博士推出面向3至18岁的AI Agent平台与终端品牌CapaLeap卡灵，提出“感创（Vibe Creating）”概念，强调灵感与创造。它没有进入提分工具或学习机主赛道，而是试图讲一个“让孩子自己思考、自己创作”的故事。</span></span><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-from-tpl="t" style="margin-bottom: 24px;outline: 0px;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-align: justify;"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-from-tpl="t" style="outline: 0px;"><section data-role="paragraph" mpa-from-tpl="t" style="outline: 0px;"><section data-role="title" data-tools="135编辑器" data-id="94063" mpa-from-tpl="t" style="outline: 0px;"><section hm_fix="374:463" mpa-from-tpl="t" style="padding-top: 10px;padding-bottom: 10px;outline: 0px;text-align: center;"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" style="outline: 0px;display: inline-block;"><section data-bgless="spin" data-bglessp="280" mpa-from-tpl="t" style="margin-bottom: -22px;outline: 0px;height: 8px;background: rgb(238, 92, 47);border-radius: 6px;overflow: hidden;margin-top: 24px;"><span leaf=""><br/></span></section><section mpa-from-tpl="t" style="margin-right: auto;margin-left: auto;padding-right: 10px;padding-left: 10px;outline: 0px;display: inline-block;height: 35px;color: rgb(63, 63, 63);line-height: 35px;font-size: 30px;transform: rotate(0deg);"><strong mpa-from-tpl="t" style="outline: 0px;" mpa-is-content="t"><strong><span leaf="">01</span></strong><span leaf=""><br/></span></strong></section></section></section><h4 style="outline: 0px;font-weight: 400;font-size: 16px;text-align: center;visibility: visible;letter-spacing: 0.544px;line-height: 1.6em;"><strong mpa-from-tpl="t" style="outline: 0px;visibility: visible;"><span style="outline: 0px;color: #EE5B2E;visibility: visible;" mpa-is-content="t"><strong><span leaf="">一条15度夹角的路线</span></strong></span><span leaf=""><br/></span></strong></h4></section></section></section></section></section></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" mpa-font-style="mv7v9iytmz5" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">理解CapaLeap的选择，先要看它绕开了什么。</span></span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" mpa-font-style="mv7v9iyt13n2" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">学习机赛道正在经历一轮残酷的集中化。据洛图科技数据，2026年一季度，中国学习平板全渠道销量125.2万台，六大品牌份额合计87.5%，比去年同期高了12.3个百分点。作业帮以32.9%的份额位居第一，学而思20.1%、科大讯飞18.5%紧随其后。</span></span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" mpa-font-style="mv7v9iytj4s" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">这条赛道的底层逻辑很清晰。学而思、作业帮走内容体系，录播课、知识框架、题库，相当于找一个规划好的补习老师；词典笔、复读机、单词卡走工具体系，服务某个具体功能。两条路殊途同归，都是内容的容器，服务于K12方向的成绩提升。</span></span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" mpa-font-style="mv7v9iytd31" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">CapaLeap没有选择挤进去，而是绕到了旁边。</span></span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span mpa-font-style="mv7v9iytehs" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span leaf=""><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">CEO杨坤用“15度夹角”来描述这个策略：市面上的主方向大家有共识，玩家众多，同向做竞争压力大、做不出差异化；</span></span><strong><span leaf=""><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">跟主方向保留一个15度的夹角，事情反而可能豁然开朗，能提供额外增量的价值</span></span></strong><span leaf=""><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">。“如果用AI Agent做K12，无非就是市面上多了一个玩家，而且我们提供的增量价值可能完全比不上教育公司对这个事情的理解深度。”</span></span></span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" mpa-font-style="mv7v9iytqdg" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">不做K12，不等于回避学科内容，区别只在于怎么教。</span></span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" mpa-font-style="mv7v9iyt10ks" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">以勾股定理为例：硬讲a²+b²=c²链路很长，但AI可以按孩子的年龄给形象化方法——两个直角边各自的正方形灌满水，倒进斜边的大正方形里正好填满。杨坤称，不直接报公式，而是让孩子能看见、能想通。在他看来，死记硬背和刷题类似“暴力求解”，考试有效，但理解原理和融会贯通才是学霸与普通人的区别。</span></span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" mpa-font-style="mv7v9iyt1tnf" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">这个定位决定了CapaLeap与学习机不同。按CapaLeap的说法，它不想做替孩子完成作业的效率工具，因为效率工具的主语是AI，孩子被动；也不想当成长伙伴，担心AI绑架孩子情感、形成依赖；更不想当老师，因为老师要给标准答案，而它想让孩子自己找。</span></span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" mpa-font-style="mv7v9iyt8kv" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">杨坤给CapaLeap的定位是copilot，或者说“创造搭子”：孩子负责思考和选择，AI负责辅助执行。</span></span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" mpa-font-style="mv7v9iyt1amn" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">这个定位是否理想化另说，但它回应了一个真实问题：Alpha世代是AI原住民，如果从小由通用AI工具直接给答案，思考力和判断力可能被一点点侵蚀。CapaLeap想抵御的正是这一趋势。</span></span><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-from-tpl="t" style="margin-bottom: 24px;outline: 0px;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-align: justify;"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-from-tpl="t" style="outline: 0px;"><section data-role="paragraph" mpa-from-tpl="t" style="outline: 0px;"><section data-role="title" data-tools="135编辑器" data-id="94063" mpa-from-tpl="t" style="outline: 0px;"><section hm_fix="374:463" mpa-from-tpl="t" style="padding-top: 10px;padding-bottom: 10px;outline: 0px;text-align: center;"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" style="outline: 0px;display: inline-block;"><section data-bgless="spin" data-bglessp="280" mpa-from-tpl="t" style="margin-bottom: -22px;outline: 0px;height: 8px;background: rgb(238, 92, 47);border-radius: 6px;overflow: hidden;margin-top: 24px;"><span leaf=""><br/></span></section><section mpa-from-tpl="t" style="margin-right: auto;margin-left: auto;padding-right: 10px;padding-left: 10px;outline: 0px;display: inline-block;height: 35px;color: rgb(63, 63, 63);line-height: 35px;font-size: 30px;transform: rotate(0deg);"><strong mpa-from-tpl="t" style="outline: 0px;" mpa-is-content="t"><strong><span leaf="">02</span></strong><span leaf=""><br/></span></strong></section></section></section><h4 style="outline: 0px;font-weight: 400;font-size: 16px;text-align: center;visibility: visible;letter-spacing: 0.544px;line-height: 1.6em;"><strong mpa-from-tpl="t" style="outline: 0px;visibility: visible;"><span style="outline: 0px;color: #EE5B2E;visibility: visible;" mpa-is-content="t"><strong><span leaf="">一脑多端，用Agent承接成长的连续性</span></strong></span><span leaf=""><br/></span></strong></h4></section></section></section></section></section></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" mpa-font-style="mv7v9iyt1bck" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">CapaLeap的产品架构可以概括为：一脑、多端、全生态。</span></span></section><section style="text-align: center;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;" data-type="image" data-ace-gallery-json="{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;fe3cce9c-8580-4663-8241-ef26b03793c8&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:495,&quot;width&quot;:744,&quot;currHeight&quot;:495,&quot;currWidth&quot;:744,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:495,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:744,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream.feishu.cn%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FJ6ebbvWYgoP9QvxaEBUcqmkanff%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;J6ebbvWYgoP9QvxaEBUcqmkanff&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:72813,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}" nodeleaf=""><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261021/6ad82a486ba32.png" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="0.6653225806451613" data-type="png" data-w="744" style="background-color: transparent;width: 100%;" data-width="744" data-height="495" data-backw="578" data-backh="385" data-imgfileid="504274423" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261021/6ad82a486ba32.png?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" mpa-font-style="mv7v9iyt1ue" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">“一脑”是CapaStudio Agent平台，为不同年龄和形态的终端提供引导式追问、任务拆解、知识理解和创作辅助。其中，Capa Memory成长档案负责把孩子在不同设备、不同年龄形成的兴趣、表达和作品连起来，根据过去沉淀的记忆、认知水平、存量输入输出记录，提供差异化服务，并随长期使用不断沉淀。</span></span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" mpa-font-style="mv7v9iyt209d" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">“多端”是一条分龄终端阶梯。</span></span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" mpa-font-style="mv7v9iyt1wxb" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">CapaCap面向3—6岁，定位AI兴趣启蒙神器，把十万个为什么装进孩子的第一台相机；CapaSnap面向5—9岁，主打AI拍学，强调从看世界到学本领；此次发布的CapaNote面向6—16岁，定位为自主学习和创造终端。杨坤透露，明年还会做穿戴形态产品，类似手机与Apple Watch的多端关系。CapaPrint则是配套的输出终端，让数字创作变成可以拿在手里的实体。</span></span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" mpa-font-style="mv7v9iyteap" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">再往上是生态层。用户共创社区里，孩子的作品可以分享、被使用、被迭代，但不做聊天式社交，也不做朋友圈式社交。共跃计划则面向教育、品牌与IP、文旅、渠道、开发者和内容创作者开放。</span></span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" mpa-font-style="mv7v9iyt1b71" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">具体场景或许更能说明产品逻辑。4岁孩子拍下一只西瓜虫，Agent先给科普，再讲故事，再切成双语，最后追问“它为什么卷成球”。探索足迹里多了一条“甲壳类”。一个孩子把暑假的陶艺课做成小游戏，Agent反问“玩家怎么赢、输了会怎样”，几轮对话出来V1.0，同学玩过之后改到V3.0。按CapaLeap的说法，迭代过程本身就是学习过程。</span></span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" mpa-font-style="mv7v9iytqen" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">CapaLeap把这套方法论定义为“感创（Vibe Creating）”。它源于2025年2月Karpathy提出&quot;vibe coding&quot;，形容创作者沉浸于自己的想法，甚至忘记代码存在。搬到孩子身上，分工就是：孩子沉浸在自己的思路里负责思考和选择，AI负责寻找工具、协助执行，把好奇心转化为可实现的作品。</span></span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><strong mpa-font-style="mv7v9iytb3q" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span leaf=""><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">这也是CapaLeap与答疑类工具最本质的区别：一个交出的是解释，另一个想交出的是作品。</span></span></strong><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-from-tpl="t" style="margin-bottom: 24px;outline: 0px;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-align: justify;"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-from-tpl="t" style="outline: 0px;"><section data-role="paragraph" mpa-from-tpl="t" style="outline: 0px;"><section data-role="title" data-tools="135编辑器" data-id="94063" mpa-from-tpl="t" style="outline: 0px;"><section hm_fix="374:463" mpa-from-tpl="t" style="padding-top: 10px;padding-bottom: 10px;outline: 0px;text-align: center;"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" style="outline: 0px;display: inline-block;"><section data-bgless="spin" data-bglessp="280" mpa-from-tpl="t" style="margin-bottom: -22px;outline: 0px;height: 8px;background: rgb(238, 92, 47);border-radius: 6px;overflow: hidden;margin-top: 24px;"><span leaf=""><br/></span></section><section mpa-from-tpl="t" style="margin-right: auto;margin-left: auto;padding-right: 10px;padding-left: 10px;outline: 0px;display: inline-block;height: 35px;color: rgb(63, 63, 63);line-height: 35px;font-size: 30px;transform: rotate(0deg);"><strong mpa-from-tpl="t" style="outline: 0px;" mpa-is-content="t"><strong><span leaf="">03</span></strong><span leaf=""><br/></span></strong></section></section></section><h4 style="outline: 0px;font-weight: 400;font-size: 16px;text-align: center;visibility: visible;letter-spacing: 0.544px;line-height: 1.6em;"><strong mpa-from-tpl="t" style="outline: 0px;visibility: visible;"><span style="outline: 0px;color: #EE5B2E;visibility: visible;" mpa-is-content="t"><strong><span leaf="">非共识的路，能不能走通</span></strong></span><span leaf=""><br/></span></strong></h4></section></section></section></section></section></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" mpa-font-style="mv7v9iyt214" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">CapaLeap选择的是一条非共识的路。非共识意味着机会，也意味着孤独。</span></span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" mpa-font-style="mv7v9iyt1aei" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">按照杨坤给出的测算，创意市场是新增市场，全国Top 10%的家庭如果能够理解并认可“用AI激发孩子无限可能”的产品逻辑，就足以支撑百亿规模；如果在学科辅助上做出有意思的东西，拿下5%份额也是几十亿级别。这个测算是否保守，取决于产品能否把“感创”从理念变成家长和孩子都能感知的日常体验。</span></span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" mpa-font-style="mv7v9iyt5l2" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">至少眼下，需求是真的。过去20个月，CapaLeap产品进入22万个家庭，孩子主动选择的日均使用时长约45分钟，六个月后仍在使用的用户比例达到46%。对于儿童硬件而言，这个留存水平并不容易。它至少说明，拍学机不是买回家吃灰的电子玩具。</span></span></section><section style="text-align: center;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;" data-type="image" data-ace-gallery-json="{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;fca07cf5-e35b-4873-9d1c-435cd5e82670&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:927,&quot;width&quot;:1385,&quot;currHeight&quot;:927,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1385,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:927,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1385,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream.feishu.cn%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FEfBjbCXOcobptoxUS5fcC06Enhg%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;EfBjbCXOcobptoxUS5fcC06Enhg&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image/jpeg&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:538628,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}" nodeleaf=""><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261021/6ad82a4895da3.jpg" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="0.66875" data-type="jpeg" data-w="1280" style="background-color: transparent;width: 100%;" data-width="1385" data-height="927" data-backw="578" data-backh="387" data-imgfileid="504274425" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261021/6ad82a4895da3.jpg?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" mpa-font-style="mv7v9iyt1xl8" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">但拍学机的局限也很明显。这个品类整体规模大约一年10亿元，白牌多，竞争卷，用户认知尚未形成共识语言。它验证了需求，却没有完全打开价值空间。CapaLeap要往更高年龄走，必须回答一个问题：当孩子不再满足于拍一拍、听一听，产品还能承接什么。</span></span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" mpa-font-style="mv7v9iyt1uk5" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">CapaNote是这个方向的延伸。拍学机的交互偏向单向输入，拍完、识别、讲解，价值直观但有限。CapaNote则让孩子用自然语言指挥AI完成绘本、播客、小游戏，产出可展示、可分享、可迭代的作品。一旦交付物足够可见、足够惊艳，增长逻辑就可能改变，从依赖投放买量转向口碑驱动的自增长。</span></span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span mpa-font-style="mv7v9iyt16jj" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><strong><span leaf=""><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">这不是此消彼长的替代关系，而是CapaLeap从单一爆品走向多产品矩阵的必经一步。</span></span></strong><span leaf=""><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">拍学机负责低龄段的启蒙和探索，CapaNote负责承接成长后的创造需求。两条产品线共同构成一个完整的用户生命周期。</span></span></span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span mpa-font-style="mv7v9iytole" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span leaf=""><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">而CapaStudio的跨设备记忆能力，正是这种粘性的技术底座。</span></span><strong><span leaf=""><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">它把一次性的硬件购买，变成一段持续积累的关系</span></span></strong><span leaf=""><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">。用户迁移成本随着作品和记忆的增多而上升，数据资产成为粘性来源。技术可以追赶，硬件可以模仿，品牌可以投放，但一个孩子几年的成长轨迹很难被复制。</span></span></span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" mpa-font-style="mv7v9iyt24w1" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">当然，风险同样清晰。非共识市场需要很多玩家一起把方向拱大，太早进入可能成为先烈。</span></span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" mpa-font-style="mv7v9iyt1nyf" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">国内的追赶压力已经摆在眼前：教育公司有内容和教研的基本盘，大厂有流量和模型优势，一旦方向被验证，跟进速度不会慢。</span></span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" mpa-font-style="mv7v9iytpz9" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">按照CapaLeap的节奏，2027年会出阶段性成果，2028年有比较大量的提升。这个时间表不算激进，也不算保守。它承认新品类需要培育，也暗示团队对产品迭代有预期。</span></span><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-from-tpl="t" style="margin-bottom: 24px;outline: 0px;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-align: justify;"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-from-tpl="t" style="outline: 0px;"><section data-role="paragraph" mpa-from-tpl="t" style="outline: 0px;"><section data-role="title" data-tools="135编辑器" data-id="94063" mpa-from-tpl="t" style="outline: 0px;"><section hm_fix="374:463" mpa-from-tpl="t" style="padding-top: 10px;padding-bottom: 10px;outline: 0px;text-align: center;"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" style="outline: 0px;display: inline-block;"><section data-bgless="spin" data-bglessp="280" mpa-from-tpl="t" style="margin-bottom: -22px;outline: 0px;height: 8px;background: rgb(238, 92, 47);border-radius: 6px;overflow: hidden;margin-top: 24px;"><span leaf=""><br/></span></section><section mpa-from-tpl="t" style="margin-right: auto;margin-left: auto;padding-right: 10px;padding-left: 10px;outline: 0px;display: inline-block;height: 35px;color: rgb(63, 63, 63);line-height: 35px;font-size: 30px;transform: rotate(0deg);"><strong mpa-from-tpl="t" style="outline: 0px;" mpa-is-content="t"><strong><span leaf="">04</span></strong><span leaf=""><br/></span></strong></section></section></section><h4 style="outline: 0px;font-weight: 400;font-size: 16px;text-align: center;visibility: visible;letter-spacing: 0.544px;line-height: 1.6em;"><strong mpa-from-tpl="t" style="outline: 0px;visibility: visible;"><span style="outline: 0px;color: #EE5B2E;visibility: visible;" mpa-is-content="t"><strong><span leaf="">结语</span></strong></span><span leaf=""><br/></span></strong></h4></section></section></section></section></section></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" mpa-font-style="mv7v9iyt1ixp" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">回到开头那个问题：当AI能秒回答案，孩子还需要学什么？</span></span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" mpa-font-style="mv7v9iyt1i7g" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">CapaLeap的答案是：学思考，学判断，学创造。</span></span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" mpa-font-style="mv7v9iyt1fuk" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">AI可以三秒给出解释，但解释之外，还有观察、怀疑、比较、验证、推翻、重建。这些动作看起来慢，却是在为一个人的思考能力打地基。</span></span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" mpa-font-style="mv7v9iyt1zr" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">CapaLeap押注的，正是这段看起来“低效”的路。</span></span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span mpa-font-style="mv7v9iyt15re" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span leaf=""><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">它</span></span><strong><span leaf=""><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">把AI放在副驾驶的位置上，让孩子决定去哪里、做什么、为什么做</span></span></strong><span leaf=""><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">。孩子说出一个模糊的想法，AI帮他找工具、搭框架、试错、迭代；作品完成时，孩子获得的不只是结果，还有把想法变成现实的经验。</span></span></span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" mpa-font-style="mv7v9iyt1qbf" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">这条路能否成立，核心在于CapaLeap能否把“感创”变成可分享、可沉淀的成长体验。如果孩子能持续产出让自己骄傲的作品，家长能看到成长档案的积累，生态伙伴能从中获得增量价值，那么CapaLeap就有机会从爆品公司走向平台品牌。反之，它可能只是拍学机之后的一次品牌升级。</span></span></section><p style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" mpa-font-style="mv7v9iyt23p8" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">当越来越多产品争着替孩子回答世界时，CapaLeap试图保留一块不被跳过的思考空间。这条路未必平坦，但方向本身，已经是一种回答。</span></span></p><p style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span style="letter-spacing: 0.5px; font-size: 15px; font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, Helvetica Neue, PingFang SC, Hiragino Sans GB, Microsoft YaHei UI, Microsoft YaHei, Arial, sans-serif; color: #FFFFFF;">（雷峰网）（雷峰网）</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><p style="display: none;"><mp-style-type data-value="3"></mp-style-type></p>]]></description>
<category>智能硬件</category>
<comments>https://www.leiphone.com/category/weiwu/2pumQSfiTnvcy26r.html#comments</comments>
<pubDate>Wed, 21 Oct 2026 11:07:00 +0800</pubDate>
</item>
<item>
<title>从安防到工业，海康威视底气从何而来</title>
<link>https://www.leiphone.com/category/5G/4rvebFOnbOPic02a.html</link>
<description><![CDATA[<section data-mpa-powered-by="yiban.io" data-pm-slice="0 0 []" style="-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px 0px 24px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family: &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;"><section style="-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;"><section style="-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;"><section style="-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;" data-mpa-action-id="mr4k8p3w210p" data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-from-tpl="t" style="-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;letter-spacing: 0.544px;visibility: visible;" data-pm-slice="0 0 []" data-mpa-action-id="mv6h6set1s3p"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" style="-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px 0px -10px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);letter-spacing: 0px;text-align: right;line-height: 25.6px;visibility: visible;" data-mpa-action-id="mv6h6tzv1ral" data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><p style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 24px; line-height: 1.75em; margin-top: 16px;"><span leaf="" mpa-font-style="mv6h6tzh1t2g" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;"><img src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261021/6ad8288b50e2a.jpg?imageView2/2/w/740"/></span></span></p><p style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;margin-top: 16px;"><span leaf="" mpa-font-style="mv6h6tzh1t2g" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">2026年中国国际工业博览会的工业自动化展区，海康威视的展台被人群围了好几层。</span></span></p><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" mpa-font-style="mv6h6tzh2qz" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">一百多款场景数字化产品铺开在眼前，从亚微米级精度的半导体封装3D AXI检测设备，到能在3200℃极限高温下看清工业现场的高清可视高温计，从为皮带托辊“悬丝诊脉”的听诊光纤，到给筒仓做三维建模的扫描成像雷达。</span></span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" mpa-font-style="mv6h6tzh155v" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">有人感叹，“海康真的不止于安防了”，也有人在这片“含AI量十足”的展台前停下来，试图想明白一个问题：这家以安防立身的公司，凭什么能在工业领域扎下这么深的根？</span></span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" mpa-font-style="mv6h6tzh221j" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">要回答这个问题，不妨把视线从展台移开，看看工业制造现场正在发生的变化。</span></span><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-from-tpl="t" style="margin-bottom: 24px;outline: 0px;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-align: justify;"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-from-tpl="t" style="outline: 0px;"><section data-role="paragraph" mpa-from-tpl="t" style="outline: 0px;"><section data-role="title" data-tools="135编辑器" data-id="94063" mpa-from-tpl="t" style="outline: 0px;"><section hm_fix="374:463" mpa-from-tpl="t" style="padding-top: 10px;padding-bottom: 10px;outline: 0px;text-align: center;"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" style="outline: 0px;display: inline-block;"><section data-bgless="spin" data-bglessp="280" mpa-from-tpl="t" style="margin-bottom: -22px;outline: 0px;height: 8px;background: rgb(238, 92, 47);border-radius: 6px;overflow: hidden;margin-top: 24px;"><span leaf=""><br/></span></section><section mpa-from-tpl="t" style="margin-right: auto;margin-left: auto;padding-right: 10px;padding-left: 10px;outline: 0px;display: inline-block;height: 35px;color: rgb(63, 63, 63);line-height: 35px;font-size: 30px;transform: rotate(0deg);"><strong mpa-from-tpl="t" style="outline: 0px;" mpa-is-content="t"><strong><span leaf="">01</span></strong><span leaf=""><br/></span></strong></section></section></section><h4 style="outline: 0px;font-weight: 400;font-size: 16px;text-align: center;visibility: visible;letter-spacing: 0.544px;line-height: 1.6em;"><strong mpa-from-tpl="t" style="outline: 0px;visibility: visible;"><span style="outline: 0px;color: #EE5B2E;visibility: visible;" mpa-is-content="t"><strong><span leaf="">场景数字化，工业升级的必答题</span></strong></span><span leaf=""><br/></span></strong></h4></section></section></section></section></section></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" mpa-font-style="mv6h6tzh1edr" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">过去二十多年，互联网数字化深刻重塑了消费、社交、金融、娱乐等行业。人和活动信息的线上化，催生了全球市值最高的科技公司，也改变了几乎每一个人的日常生活。</span></span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" mpa-font-style="mv6h6tzh1qoz" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">但这波浪潮有一个边界，它完成的是人与活动信息的数字化，物理世界本身，那些庞大的工厂、运转的产线、高温的炉膛、绵延数公里的皮带，它们的数字化进程远未完成。</span></span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" mpa-font-style="mv6h6tzhsmw" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">当前，AI大模型与多维感知技术正加速成熟，物理世界物联网数据的数字化正在释放巨大的产业空间。据赛迪顾问数据，2025年中国工业互联网市场规模达到12587.8亿元，同比增长12.6%，预计到2028年将达16753.5亿元，工业互联网将进一步向智能化、数据驱动和系统级协同方向演进。这是一条厚雪长坡的赛道。</span></span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" mpa-font-style="mv6h6tzh1ohh" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">政策层面的信号同样明确。“十五五”规划纲要提出“实施新技术新产品新场景大规模应用示范行动，加大场景培育和开放力度”，2026年《政府工作报告》进一步提出“打造智能经济新形态”，强调深化拓展“人工智能+”。</span></span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" mpa-font-style="mv6h6tzh91m" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">场景的价值正在于此，它把技术创新从实验室搬到真实的场景中，成为新技术新产品的“试验场”，架起研发与市场的桥梁，加速科技创新成果向现实生产力转化。</span></span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" mpa-font-style="mv6h6tzhphg" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">中国工业从“全”到“强”的升级，恰恰需要这种场景思维。中国拥有41个工业大类、207个中类、666个小类，是全球唯一拥有联合国产业分类中全部工业门类的国家。</span></span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" mpa-font-style="mv6h6tzhy2v" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">这种“全、多、大”的特征，意味着工业场景的碎片化程度远超想象。一套通用方案包打天下的时代已经过去，技术必须在真实场景中试炼，在具体问题中生效。</span></span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><strong mpa-font-style="mv6h6tzh4b9" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span leaf=""><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">这正是海康威视讲“场景数字化”的底层逻辑。场景是落脚点，数字化是路径。</span></span></strong></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" mpa-font-style="mv6h6tzhli2" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">行业内不少厂商单独讲“场景”或单独讲“数字化”，但将二者结合形成统一产业认知的并不多见。</span></span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" mpa-font-style="mv6h6tzh1y07" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">海康威视之所以能明确提出这一概念，是因为它同时具备几个条件：</span></span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" mpa-font-style="mv6h6tzhvsn" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">从可见光起步拓展到红外、X光、毫米波、声波等多维感知技术体系，能够深入物理世界帮助用户采集各类数据；</span></span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" mpa-font-style="mv6h6tzhrey" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">海康观澜大模型实现了多模态大模型与行业知识的深度融合，能在具体场景中读懂数据、解决问题；</span></span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" mpa-font-style="mv6h6tzh2098" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">更重要的是技术延伸逻辑，海康威视几乎所有工业技术都能在安防领域找到成熟的技术前身。</span></span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" mpa-font-style="mv6h6tzh1ink" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">安防要“看清异常”，工业要“感知数据”；安防要“智能预警”，工业要“预测性维护”，二者都需要感知与智能的结合。</span></span><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-from-tpl="t" style="margin-bottom: 24px;outline: 0px;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-align: justify;"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-from-tpl="t" style="outline: 0px;"><section data-role="paragraph" mpa-from-tpl="t" style="outline: 0px;"><section data-role="title" data-tools="135编辑器" data-id="94063" mpa-from-tpl="t" style="outline: 0px;"><section hm_fix="374:463" mpa-from-tpl="t" style="padding-top: 10px;padding-bottom: 10px;outline: 0px;text-align: center;"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" style="outline: 0px;display: inline-block;"><section data-bgless="spin" data-bglessp="280" mpa-from-tpl="t" style="margin-bottom: -22px;outline: 0px;height: 8px;background: rgb(238, 92, 47);border-radius: 6px;overflow: hidden;margin-top: 24px;"><span leaf=""><br/></span></section><section mpa-from-tpl="t" style="margin-right: auto;margin-left: auto;padding-right: 10px;padding-left: 10px;outline: 0px;display: inline-block;height: 35px;color: rgb(63, 63, 63);line-height: 35px;font-size: 30px;transform: rotate(0deg);"><strong mpa-from-tpl="t" style="outline: 0px;" mpa-is-content="t"><strong><span leaf="">02</span></strong><span leaf=""><br/></span></strong></section></section></section><h4 style="outline: 0px;font-weight: 400;font-size: 16px;text-align: center;visibility: visible;letter-spacing: 0.544px;line-height: 1.6em;"><strong mpa-from-tpl="t" style="outline: 0px;visibility: visible;"><span style="outline: 0px;color: #EE5B2E;visibility: visible;" mpa-is-content="t"><strong><span leaf="">感知与AI的「飞轮效应」</span></strong></span><span leaf=""><br/></span></strong></h4></section></section></section></section></section></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" mpa-font-style="mv6h6tzh24wv" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">理解场景数字化的重要性之后，下一个问题是：海康威视凭什么能做好这件事？答案藏在它多年积累的感知与AI能力之中。</span></span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><strong mpa-font-style="mv6h6tzhfgs" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span leaf=""><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">首先在于感知技术的全面性。</span></span></strong></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" mpa-font-style="mv6h6tzh1h8q" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">工业场景的碎片化，意味着单一感知手段往往难以适配复杂工况。正如人类不能只靠眼睛认识世界，工业领域的信息获取也需要“眼耳鼻舌身”的协同。海康威视已构建起覆盖可见光、红外、X光、毫米波、融合光谱、声波等多领域的物联感知技术体系。公司在售硬件产品型号超过3万个，软件产品100多款，能够满足各行各业不同场景的差异化需求。</span></span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" mpa-font-style="mv6h6tzh1k0e" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">这种多维感知能力的价值，在芯片质量检测场景中就得到了体现。</span></span></section><section style="text-align: center;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;" data-type="image" data-ace-gallery-json="{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;6657ddce-cd82-4d78-9b87-5b05240860d7&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:3136,&quot;width&quot;:4704,&quot;currHeight&quot;:3136,&quot;currWidth&quot;:4704,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:3136,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:4704,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream.feishu.cn%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FChq5bqSRkoYRNGxYelRcUre5nFb%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;Chq5bqSRkoYRNGxYelRcUre5nFb&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image/jpeg&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:1738262,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}" nodeleaf=""><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261021/6ad827c59b0c7.jpg" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="0.6666666666666666" data-type="jpeg" data-w="4704" style="background-color: transparent;width: 100%;" data-width="4704" data-height="3136" data-backw="578" data-backh="385" data-imgfileid="504274378" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261021/6ad827c59b0c7.jpg?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" mpa-font-style="mv6h6tzh1w5c" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">针对芯片检测这一典型复杂场景，海康构建了从宏观到微观、从内部到表面、从量测到物质分析的完整产品体系：高精度半导体封装3D AXI检测设备拥有亚微米级透视检测能力，可精准识别内部金线、焊点、贯穿型缺陷等芯片深层缺陷；超声显微镜可识别微米级缺陷，对平面层裂痕检测灵敏度极高；超景深3D数码显微镜能清晰捕捉芯片表面划痕、溢胶等微观缺陷；质谱与色谱设备可精准检测芯片焊盘表面是否残留光刻胶、助焊剂等有机污染物……</span></span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><strong mpa-font-style="mv6h6tzh1bjh" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span leaf=""><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">感知之外，AI大模型赋予了海康威视解决“老大难”问题的能力。</span></span></strong></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" mpa-font-style="mv6h6tzh1sso" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">传统工业检测方案面临的核心困境在于：每个场景都需要单独采集数据、标注训练、调试部署，周期长达数周、成本高昂，且产品一换型就要推倒重来。海康观澜大模型的小样本学习与强泛化能力，则大幅降低了这一门槛。</span></span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" mpa-font-style="mv6h6tzh229q" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">以海康睿影的X-ray工业检测大模型为例，过去一个检测对象，需要数千至上万张标注图片，如今仅需几十张样本即可完成模型训练部署。某些特殊场景下，凭借无监督的大模型技术，仅需3至5张样本即可快速上线，极大提升了迭代效率。大模型基于海量多行业数据完成预训练，掌握缺陷通用本质特征，能分清“真缺陷”和“长得像缺陷的正常形态”，判定边界更清晰、识别逻辑更贴合工业实景，有效降低误报、提升整体检测准确率。</span></span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" mpa-font-style="mv6h6tzhj62" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">同样，在超声检测领域，海康威视自主研发了知识增强信号重建网络和超声大模型，通过自适应噪声分离、先验知识嵌入、自监督预训练加少样本迁移、自动定量分析等方法，让AI像资深老师傅一样精准读懂波形与信号。在新能源汽车零部件检测场景中，单工件检测效率提升60%以上，缺陷识别准确率不低于99.5%。</span></span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" mpa-font-style="mv6h6tzh20p8" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">这种“感知+AI”能力的叠加，形成了海康威视在工业领域的一种独特定位：既能用多维感知手段“看得见”工业场景中各类要素，又能用AI大模型“看得懂”数据背后的含义。</span></span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" mpa-font-style="mv6h6tzhc7g" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">物联感知、AI这两大核心技术，就像一对“飞轮”，相互驱动。物联感知技术的发展，将物理世界数字化，可为AI能力的飞跃提供场景支撑；AI能力的发展，又能不断提升物联感知设备的性能，并催生出大量工业级应用。</span></span><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-from-tpl="t" style="margin-bottom: 24px;outline: 0px;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-align: justify;"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-from-tpl="t" style="outline: 0px;"><section data-role="paragraph" mpa-from-tpl="t" style="outline: 0px;"><section data-role="title" data-tools="135编辑器" data-id="94063" mpa-from-tpl="t" style="outline: 0px;"><section hm_fix="374:463" mpa-from-tpl="t" style="padding-top: 10px;padding-bottom: 10px;outline: 0px;text-align: center;"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" style="outline: 0px;display: inline-block;"><section data-bgless="spin" data-bglessp="280" mpa-from-tpl="t" style="margin-bottom: -22px;outline: 0px;height: 8px;background: rgb(238, 92, 47);border-radius: 6px;overflow: hidden;margin-top: 24px;"><span leaf=""><br/></span></section><section mpa-from-tpl="t" style="margin-right: auto;margin-left: auto;padding-right: 10px;padding-left: 10px;outline: 0px;display: inline-block;height: 35px;color: rgb(63, 63, 63);line-height: 35px;font-size: 30px;transform: rotate(0deg);"><strong mpa-from-tpl="t" style="outline: 0px;" mpa-is-content="t"><strong><span leaf="">03</span></strong><span leaf=""><br/></span></strong></section></section></section><h4 style="outline: 0px;font-weight: 400;font-size: 16px;text-align: center;visibility: visible;letter-spacing: 0.544px;line-height: 1.6em;"><strong mpa-from-tpl="t" style="outline: 0px;visibility: visible;"><span style="outline: 0px;color: #EE5B2E;visibility: visible;" mpa-is-content="t"><strong><span leaf="">场景中的答卷</span></strong></span><span leaf=""><br/></span></strong></h4></section></section></section></section></section></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" mpa-font-style="mv6h6tzh1tyx" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">能力是否有效，最终要到场景中检验。</span></span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span mpa-font-style="mv6h6tzh149t" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span leaf=""><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">在</span></span><strong><span leaf=""><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">质量检测领域</span></span></strong><span leaf=""><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">，折叠屏手机铰链检测是海康睿影攻下的一个标志性场景。</span></span></span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" mpa-font-style="mv6h6tzhk0b" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">2022年底，折叠屏铰链仍属于新兴工艺，产品结构精密复杂、缺陷特征细微、成像干扰极强，生产过程衍生十余类疑难缺陷，靠人眼及传统光学检测设备无法有效识别。</span></span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" mpa-font-style="mv6h6tzhbda" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">海康睿影与客户组建专项攻坚团队，基于X射线大模型智能检测系统，实现对裂纹、气孔、异物等各类缺陷的稳定检出，精度最小可达0.05mm。通过X光AI全检，不良率下降1个数量级，大幅提升产品良率。该方案率先落地头部标杆客户后，迅速向全手机行业扩展。</span></span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span mpa-font-style="mv6h6tzh13gr" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span leaf=""><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">在</span></span><strong><span leaf=""><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">生产运营领域</span></span></strong><span leaf=""><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">，产线行为SOP检测方案已经跑出规模化复制的节奏。</span></span></span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" mpa-font-style="mv6h6tzh144u" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">柔性制造趋势下，同一条产线快速切换品类、按需排产，不同产品、工位、物料的作业标准差异大，如何保证产品质量成为难题。</span></span></section><section style="text-align: center;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;" data-type="image" data-ace-gallery-json="{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;34fe9987-a1aa-45cc-b97b-09fdb70d8816&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:3200,&quot;width&quot;:4800,&quot;currHeight&quot;:3200,&quot;currWidth&quot;:4800,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:3200,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:4800,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream.feishu.cn%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FExmFbxnQroShH3x6oAScqKQQnRc%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;ExmFbxnQroShH3x6oAScqKQQnRc&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image/jpeg&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:2120603,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}" nodeleaf=""><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261021/6ad827c5c82ff.jpg" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="0.6666666666666666" data-type="jpeg" data-w="4800" style="background-color: transparent;width: 100%;" data-width="4800" data-height="3200" data-backw="578" data-backh="385" data-imgfileid="504274379" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261021/6ad827c5c82ff.jpg?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" mpa-font-style="mv6h6tzh1ywi" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">海康威视打造的SOP行为检测系统方案，自带开箱即用的常见产线算法，面对新工件、新场景仅需1至8张图片即可适配，实现分钟级部署。在海康威视重庆、桐庐、武汉生产基地的600余个核心工位上线后，单位工位相较原人工方式提效最高达80%。</span></span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" mpa-font-style="mv6h6tzh1tgn" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">理想汽车供应链体系中的继峰座椅通过SOP行为检测系统，座椅C型钉漏打率大幅下降至最低0.01%，并将方案复用到上下游供应商团队。动力系统供应商联合动力覆盖了100%关键作业工序，从定子装配到端子压接，AI全程巡检，实时校验操作规范。</span></span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" mpa-font-style="mv6h6tzh1jas" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">目前，海康威视SOP方案已在全国累计落地数百个项目，覆盖汽车零部件、3C电子、半导体、食品包装等多行业。</span></span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span mpa-font-style="mv6h6tzh9ic" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span leaf=""><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">在</span></span><strong><span leaf=""><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">设备监测领域</span></span></strong><span leaf=""><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">，海康威视在业内首创的定位型听诊光纤提供了一个“深水区”解决方案。</span></span></span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" mpa-font-style="mv6h6tzheu9" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">工业皮带在国内约有三十万条，一些长皮带造价达上亿元。传统巡检依赖人眼和人耳，环境恶劣、噪声大、粉尘重，长皮带长达数公里，巡检耗时困难。海康威视创新性地将光纤传感探头安装在皮带传输机上，通过采集托辊声音结合AI算法精准定位故障。</span></span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" mpa-font-style="mv6h6tzhh7" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">这项技术获得了2025全国创新方法大赛唯一金奖，已在南京钢铁、华新水泥、华东材料等多家企业落地应用。</span></span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span mpa-font-style="mv6h6tzhd4b" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span leaf=""><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">在</span></span><strong><span leaf=""><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">机器人与雷达领域</span></span></strong><span leaf=""><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">，海康威视的市场验证数据同样扎实。</span></span></span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" mpa-font-style="mv6h6tzh194x" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">2025年海康机器人全年营收64.52亿元，截至目前，海康机器人视觉产品累计出货超1000万台，移动机器人下线突破20万台，国内市场每两台工业相机、每三台移动机器人中，就有一台来自海康机器人，累计服务客户超2万家。</span></span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" mpa-font-style="mv6h6tzhm4i" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">海康工业雷达从车载领域的技术积累延伸而来，构建了从一维单点测距的物位计，到二维截面成像雷达，再到三维扫描成像雷达和四维避障雷达的完整产品体系。在陕西商洛发电，激光扫描成像雷达短短3分钟就能完成一次全方位盘库，准确率达到97%以上，盘煤效率较以往提升几十倍。</span></span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" mpa-font-style="mv6h6tzh15cm" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">值得一提的是，海康威视自身也是这些技术最直接的试验场。</span></span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" mpa-font-style="mv6h6tzhtwi" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">海康威视智能工厂硬件产品型号达3万余种，日均处理订单1.4万个，每个订单平均仅约30台，定配置比例高达70%。面对这种“多品种、小批量、大规模定制”的生产特点，海康威视将自研的物联感知、AI大模型等技术深度融入制造全流程，超过1500台移动机器人协同作业，智能摄像机全自动化无人生产线较传统线体效率提升243%。2025年，海康威视智能制造工厂入选全国首批领航级智能工厂培育名单。</span></span><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-from-tpl="t" style="margin-bottom: 24px;outline: 0px;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-align: justify;"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-from-tpl="t" style="outline: 0px;"><section data-role="paragraph" mpa-from-tpl="t" style="outline: 0px;"><section data-role="title" data-tools="135编辑器" data-id="94063" mpa-from-tpl="t" style="outline: 0px;"><section hm_fix="374:463" mpa-from-tpl="t" style="padding-top: 10px;padding-bottom: 10px;outline: 0px;text-align: center;"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" style="outline: 0px;display: inline-block;"><section data-bgless="spin" data-bglessp="280" mpa-from-tpl="t" style="margin-bottom: -22px;outline: 0px;height: 8px;background: rgb(238, 92, 47);border-radius: 6px;overflow: hidden;margin-top: 24px;"><span leaf=""><br/></span></section><section mpa-from-tpl="t" style="margin-right: auto;margin-left: auto;padding-right: 10px;padding-left: 10px;outline: 0px;display: inline-block;height: 35px;color: rgb(63, 63, 63);line-height: 35px;font-size: 30px;transform: rotate(0deg);"><strong mpa-from-tpl="t" style="outline: 0px;" mpa-is-content="t"><strong><span leaf="">04</span></strong><span leaf=""><br/></span></strong></section></section></section><h4 style="outline: 0px;font-weight: 400;font-size: 16px;text-align: center;visibility: visible;letter-spacing: 0.544px;line-height: 1.6em;"><strong mpa-from-tpl="t" style="outline: 0px;visibility: visible;"><span style="outline: 0px;color: #EE5B2E;visibility: visible;" mpa-is-content="t"><strong><span leaf="">结语</span></strong></span><span leaf=""><br/></span></strong></h4></section></section></section></section></section></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" mpa-font-style="mv6h6tzhbpg" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">上一波互联网数字化浪潮，完成了人和活动信息的线上化，释放了巨大的产业红利。而物理世界的数字化，正在开启一个同样广阔的产业空间。</span></span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" mpa-font-style="mv6h6tzhee7" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">工厂里的每一台设备、每一条产线、每一道工序，都蕴含着等待被感知、被理解、被优化的需求。</span></span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" mpa-font-style="mv6h6tzhd8b" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">海康威视要做的事情，就是架起物理世界与数字世界之间的那座桥梁。用覆盖可见光、红外、X光、毫米波、声波等多维度的感知能力，将物理世界的信息转化为可分析的数字信号；用海康观澜大模型读懂这些信号背后的含义，辅助决策、指导执行，让工业制造真正实现从“看见”到“看懂”的跃迁。</span></span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" mpa-font-style="mv6h6tzh2121" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">工业的数字化、智能化升级，始于每一个真实场景。</span></span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" mpa-font-style="mv6h6tzh19ee" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">从展台上的一百余款产品，到产线上的一个个工位，再到千行百业的一个个细分应用场景，海康威视的场景数字化实践正在回答一个根本性的命题：</span></span></section><p style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" mpa-font-style="mv6h6tzh6d1" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">当技术走出实验室，走进工业现场，走进每一个具体的生产环节，它创造的价值才真正落地生根。而这，正是物理世界数字化浪潮中最坚实的底座。</span></span></p><p style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span style="letter-spacing: 0.5px; font-size: 15px; font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, Helvetica Neue, PingFang SC, Hiragino Sans GB, Microsoft YaHei UI, Microsoft YaHei, Arial, sans-serif; color: #FFFFFF;">（雷峰网）（雷峰网）</span></p></section><section style="text-align: center;margin-bottom: 0px;margin-top: 40px;" nodeleaf=""><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261021/6ad827c62b8b4.png" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="1.228" data-s="300,640" data-type="png" data-w="1000" style="width: 100%;background-color: transparent;" data-croporisrc="https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/ACzflXDibhg6QK0zN8Exsib9nnzIEV53iaYZoTPVhyk6TZHhWR20ByNFDLHKUwpscRzDxkSxtf1kkq2Apsd6FPAsnH3IQkOT8o7yy8sfswu4MY/0?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg" data-cropselx1="0" data-cropselx2="578" data-cropsely1="0" data-cropsely2="710" data-backw="578" data-backh="710" data-imgfileid="504272501" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261021/6ad827c62b8b4.png?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section></section></section></section></section></section><p style="display: none;"><mp-style-type data-value="3"></mp-style-type></p>]]></description>
<category>物联网</category>
