<description><![CDATA[<section data-mpa-powered-by="yiban.io" data-pm-slice="0 0 []" nodeleaf=""></section><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section mpa-from-tpl="t"><section mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-role="title" data-tools="135编辑器" data-id="107772" data-color="#ee5b2e" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section mpa-from-tpl="t"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" nodeleaf=""></section><section mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-brushtype="text" hm_fix="325:484" mpa-from-tpl="t" style="text-align: center;"><span style="font-size: 24px;"><strong>要闻提示</strong></span></section><section data-width="100%" mpa-from-tpl="t"><br/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section data-mpa-action-id="mvfheo8r1821" data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><section style="text-align: justify;">1.停止加薪！大众计划冻结员工薪酬至2030年，涉及全球大量员工</section><p style="text-align: justify;">2.突发！美国发布DeepSeek禁令</p><section style="text-align: justify;">3.花钱之前先问网友意见！「钱包请等等」突然爆火：主打「劝你别买」</section><section style="text-align: justify;">4.豆包辟谣超一半算力在造爽剧：不靠谱，只有10%</section><section style="text-align: justify;">5.特斯拉喊话：没有「速成车」</section><section style="text-align: justify;">6.“山姆品质暴跌你还敢去吗”热搜第一，山姆回应：热搜视频系AI造假</section><section style="text-align: justify;">7.字节Seed模型评测负责人黄文灏离职</section><p style="text-align: justify;">8.马斯克：明年向全美儿童赠送 SpaceX 股票</p><p style="text-align: center;"><span style="font-size: 24px;"><strong>今日头条</strong></span></p></section><section data-mpa-action-id="mmxst4fs1xis" data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mbam1od114ht" data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><section mpa-from-tpl="t"><section mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-action-id="mr4k8p3w210p" data-pm-slice="5 5 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;data-mpa-powered-by&quot;:&quot;yiban.io&quot;,&quot;data-pm-slice&quot;:&quot;0 0 []&quot;,&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px 0px 24px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family: \&quot;PingFang SC\&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \&quot;Helvetica Neue\&quot;, \&quot;Hiragino Sans GB\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei UI\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei\&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mti9tap9bwj" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><p data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1" style="text-align: justify;"><strong>停止加薪！大众计划冻结员工薪酬至2030年，涉及全球大量员工</strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p style="text-align: justify;">10 月 19 日消息，外媒披露的高管内部文件显示，大众汽车计划在 2030 年之前，冻结（不加薪）其全球 60 万名员工中大部分人的薪资。在被问及此事时，大众汽车表示不对“此类猜测”置评，仅表示即将展开的新一轮集体薪酬谈判，才是劳资双方在企业内部沟通并敲定各项协议的正规渠道。</p><p style="text-align: justify;">这一不涨薪的计划将使大众汽车在德国的员工面临进一步的压力。作为 2024 年成本削减方案的一部分，大众汽车旗下受全公司集体谈判协议覆盖的 13 万名员工，此前已同意推迟原定 5.5% 的加薪。</p><p style="text-align: justify;">报道称，由于通货膨胀，多年的工资零增长将在未来几年内使德国员工的实际收入减少多达10%。这份内部文件显示，“鉴于大众集团面临的严峻形势”，全球范围内的集体谈判将适用新的指导方针，并从 2026 年第四季度起立刻生效。这些指导方针还包括减少浮动薪酬、特殊补贴和福利。其核心诉求十分明确：降低人力成本。（IT之家）</p><p style="text-align: center;"><span style="font-size: 24px;"><strong>国内资讯</strong></span></p></section></section><section data-mpa-action-id="mn1x90q0pw9" data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><section data-style-type="5" data-id="745895" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section mpa-from-tpl="t"><section mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-role="title" data-tools="135编辑器" data-id="107772" data-color="#ee5b2e" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-action-id="mr4k8p3w210p" data-pm-slice="5 5 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;data-mpa-powered-by&quot;:&quot;yiban.io&quot;,&quot;data-pm-slice&quot;:&quot;0 0 []&quot;,&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px 0px 24px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family: \&quot;PingFang SC\&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \&quot;Helvetica Neue\&quot;, \&quot;Hiragino Sans GB\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei UI\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei\&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mti9tap9bwj" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><p data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1" style="text-align: justify;"><strong>突发！美国发布DeepSeek禁令</strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p style="text-align: justify;">10月20日消息，据媒体报道，美国方面突然针对中国AI企业DeepSeek出台了针对性的限制措施。</p><p style="text-align: justify;">美国国土安全部正式发布规定，禁止在美国政府计算机系统中使用中国人工智能公司DeepSeek的全系列产品，相关公告已经公开发布在美国政府官方文件汇编《联邦公报》的正式通知里。</p><p style="text-align: justify;">据悉，美国国土安全部已经正式下令，要求所有民事部门的IT信息系统，必须删除所有DeepSeek产品、与该公司相关的全部开发成果，以及所有使用DeepSeek开发成果创建的第三方衍生产品。</p><section style="text-align: justify;">除此之外，这份指令还明确划定了后续的准入红线，所有受管辖的美国联邦民事部门，后续都不得再采购DeepSeek旗下的任何相关产品，从采购源头直接切断该产品进入美国政务系统的可能性。美方声称，DeepSeek公司的开发成果构成威胁。（快科技）</section><section data-type="image" data-ace-gallery-json="{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;91d7f7f1-7563-4e0a-8f29-27dfe45d3ef7&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:242.97777777777776,&quot;width&quot;:568,&quot;currHeight&quot;:242.97777777777776,&quot;currWidth&quot;:568,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:462,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1080,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:0.5259259259259259,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream.feishu.cn%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FJOt7bK3Gvo9T43xNb73c7aXpn5c%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;JOt7bK3Gvo9T43xNb73c7aXpn5c&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:129431,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}" nodeleaf="" style="text-align: center;"><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261020/6ad7439f4833c.png" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="0.42777777777777776" data-type="png" data-w="1080" style="background-color: transparent;width: 100%;" data-width="1080" data-height="462" data-backw="578" data-backh="247" data-imgfileid="504274650" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261020/6ad7439f4833c.png?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section></section></section><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mvfwomvl1n65"><section data-mpa-action-id="mr4k8p3w210p" data-pm-slice="5 5 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;data-mpa-powered-by&quot;:&quot;yiban.io&quot;,&quot;data-pm-slice&quot;:&quot;0 0 []&quot;,&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px 0px 24px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family: \&quot;PingFang SC\&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \&quot;Helvetica Neue\&quot;, \&quot;Hiragino Sans GB\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei UI\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei\&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mti9tap9bwj" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><p data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1" style="text-align: justify;"><strong>花钱之前先问网友意见！「钱包请等等」突然爆火：主打「劝你别买」</strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p style="text-align: justify;">10月19日消息，近日，一款名叫“钱包请等等”的小程序凭借“劝你别买”的方式突然爆火。开发者是一名26岁的产品经理。他偶然刷到“用表格做消费审批”的玩法，便靠着AI工具花8天就搓出了这个爆款小程序。小程序上线9小时便破万，吸引超30万人。玩法很简单：消费前，用户需匿名提交购物申请，写清商品价格、购买理由和替代方案；提交后，由陌生网友投票审批。</p><p style="text-align: justify;">开发者“火山”的本意是集思广益帮大家理性消费、省点钱。结果上线没多久，各种各样画风清奇的申请出现了：有人想花 15 元吃一份黑森林，有人纠结要不要买 22.5 元的奶茶，还有人把请一天假的损失折算成 500 元，请网友判断这一天休息到底值不值。甚至还有想“合法购买宇宙飞船”的，价格长到数不清多少个零，购买理由就四个字：攻打宇宙。</p><section style="text-align: justify;">此外，任凭购买理由说得天花乱坠，大家都不支持购买一个 285 元的手机壳。花 8000 块自费换工作电脑的申请也被驳回了，因为大家一致认为“不能倒贴钱上班”。（酷玩实验室、都市现场）</section><section data-type="image" data-ace-gallery-json="{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;5ea3cd2a-4ab0-4871-8c35-126a4701395c&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:403.02527233115467,&quot;width&quot;:514,&quot;currHeight&quot;:403.02527233115467,&quot;currWidth&quot;:514,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:3599,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:4590,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:0.11198257080610022,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream.feishu.cn%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FKHKcbyEqWoI2xxx9EXXcFVctnme%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;KHKcbyEqWoI2xxx9EXXcFVctnme&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image/jpeg&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:1074698,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}" nodeleaf="" style="text-align: center;"><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261020/6ad7439f6c3b5.jpg" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="0.7833333333333333" data-type="jpeg" data-w="1080" style="background-color: transparent;" data-width="4590" data-height="3599" data-imgfileid="504274641" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261020/6ad7439f6c3b5.jpg?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mvfhlbqaol5" data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><section data-mpa-action-id="mr4k8p3w210p" data-pm-slice="5 5 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;data-mpa-powered-by&quot;:&quot;yiban.io&quot;,&quot;data-pm-slice&quot;:&quot;0 0 []&quot;,&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px 0px 24px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family: \&quot;PingFang SC\&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \&quot;Helvetica Neue\&quot;, \&quot;Hiragino Sans GB\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei UI\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei\&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mti9tap9bwj" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><p data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1" style="text-align: justify;"><strong>豆包辟谣超一半算力在造爽剧：不靠谱，只有10%</strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p style="text-align: justify;">10月19日消息，近日，“国内超一半算力在造爽剧”的话题，引发广泛关注。</p><p style="text-align: justify;">有媒体披露，国内AI Token消耗55%烧在短剧和视频生成，24%烧在电商广告，真正用于研发的，只有15%。抖音一个平台就新上线AI短剧22万部，一部12集短剧，要烧掉近20万元的算力成本。AI短剧与视频生成的Token消耗量已达到软件开发的两倍以上，成为整个Token经济学中第一大核心消耗场景。</p><section style="text-align: justify;">对此消息，豆包公关负责人刘星发文表示，这个算力数据有些不靠谱，就字节来说，我们公司的总算力中，只有约10%，用于视频生成模型的训练和推理。（鞭牛士）</section><section data-type="image" data-ace-gallery-json="{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;cf34d447-cc89-4772-a3c9-9a1888804db9&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:404.2037037037037,&quot;width&quot;:460,&quot;currHeight&quot;:404.2037037037037,&quot;currWidth&quot;:460,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:949,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1080,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:0.42592592592592593,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream.feishu.cn%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FWH4ObKkqHoZh1Dxww2QcmTe1nob%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;WH4ObKkqHoZh1Dxww2QcmTe1nob&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image/jpeg&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:128727,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}" nodeleaf="" style="text-align: center;"><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261020/6ad7439f9ae51.jpg" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="0.8787037037037037" data-type="jpeg" data-w="1080" style="background-color: transparent;width: 100%;" data-width="1080" data-height="949" data-backw="578" data-backh="508" data-imgfileid="504274639" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261020/6ad7439f9ae51.jpg?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mvfhllw6qim" data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><section data-mpa-action-id="mr4k8p3w210p" data-pm-slice="5 5 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;data-mpa-powered-by&quot;:&quot;yiban.io&quot;,&quot;data-pm-slice&quot;:&quot;0 0 []&quot;,&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px 0px 24px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family: \&quot;PingFang SC\&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \&quot;Helvetica Neue\&quot;, \&quot;Hiragino Sans GB\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei UI\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei\&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mti9tap9bwj" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><p data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1" style="text-align: justify;"><strong>特斯拉喊话：没有「速成车」</strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p style="text-align: justify;">10月19日消息，特斯拉发文强调品牌没有“速成车”。特斯拉表示，特斯拉在中国采用直营模式，不设传统意义上的4S店，销售、交付、客服及售后技师等环节均由品牌方直接管理。</p><p style="text-align: justify;">随后，特斯拉副总裁陶琳转发该微博并表示：“安全稳定可靠，让人安心是最大的豪华。”&nbsp;</p><section style="text-align: justify;"><p>这并非陶琳首次就“速成车”公开表态。今年7月，陶琳表示，特斯拉不做“快消品”，也相信持久可靠和创新是可以兼得的。（鞭牛士）</p><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-action-id="mr4k8p3w210p" data-pm-slice="5 5 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;data-mpa-powered-by&quot;:&quot;yiban.io&quot;,&quot;data-pm-slice&quot;:&quot;0 0 []&quot;,&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px 0px 24px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family: \&quot;PingFang SC\&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \&quot;Helvetica Neue\&quot;, \&quot;Hiragino Sans GB\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei UI\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei\&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mti9tap9bwj" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><p data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><strong>“山姆品质暴跌你还敢去吗”热搜第一，山姆回应：热搜视频系AI造假</strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p style="text-align: justify;">10月19日消息，“山姆品质暴跌你还敢去吗”日前发酵为微博热搜第一。该热搜由多个视频组成——视频中有顾客在山姆门店集中维权，并称山姆“原来的好产品下架”。</p><p style="text-align: justify;">有视频称“山姆以前好吃的产品都下架了”，其中提到“低糖蛋黄酥”“棒棒娃麻辣牛肉”“NFC石榴汁”。对此，山姆会员商店相关负责人回应媒体称，目前这三款产品均正常销售。此外，视频中还提到“山姆原来好用的产品不见了”，包括“柚可言”洗发水、“中华牌”女士奶粉、“多牧原”奶粉。“这些视频中提及的品牌商品从未在山姆上架出售。”该负责人表示。</p><p style="text-align: justify;">山姆方面表示，多个社交媒体平台上集中出现了数千条针对山姆的恶意攻击及虚假营销信息。部分不良主体账号通过AI（人工智能）生成、拼接素材、伪造采访等方式，批量制造内容高度雷同、形式极其相似的不实信息攻击山姆的品质管理，实则是将从未在山姆上架的洗护、保健品、食品等品类的商品，编造成“山姆下架好物”的虚假信息进行欺骗性营销，引流牟利。（每日经济新闻）</p><section data-type="image" data-ace-gallery-json="{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;8b02852f-2167-4355-8be0-54bb732dd17d&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:277.3333333333333,&quot;width&quot;:576,&quot;currHeight&quot;:277.3333333333333,&quot;currWidth&quot;:576,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:520,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1080,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:0.5333333333333333,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream.feishu.cn%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FX2R5bvfBEomdgKx72bqcmwpOnxe%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;X2R5bvfBEomdgKx72bqcmwpOnxe&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:1008941,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}" nodeleaf="" style="text-align: center;"><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261020/6ad743a003c68.png" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="0.48148148148148145" data-type="png" data-w="1080" style="background-color: transparent;width: 100%;" data-width="1080" data-height="520" data-backw="578" data-backh="278" data-imgfileid="504274640" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261020/6ad743a003c68.png?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mvfhm0wszzj" data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><section data-mpa-action-id="mr4k8p3w210p" data-pm-slice="5 5 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;data-mpa-powered-by&quot;:&quot;yiban.io&quot;,&quot;data-pm-slice&quot;:&quot;0 0 []&quot;,&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px 0px 24px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family: \&quot;PingFang SC\&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \&quot;Helvetica Neue\&quot;, \&quot;Hiragino Sans GB\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei UI\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei\&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mti9tap9bwj" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><p data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1" style="text-align: justify;"><strong>零跑B10在萨拉戈萨工厂正式量产，全球战略布局落地重要产业化成果</strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p style="text-align: justify;">10月19日消息，媒体近日获悉，零跑与Stellantis集团的战略合作迎来重要产业化成果：零跑B10在位于西班牙的萨拉戈萨工厂正式启动量产。</p><p style="text-align: justify;">报道称，西班牙萨拉戈萨工厂依托Stellantis集团成熟的制造体系、深厚的工业经验和欧洲产业布局，结合零跑在新能源汽车技术、产品开发和创新效率方面的优势，实现零跑B10本地化生产。双方将各自优势与对欧洲市场及消费者的深入了解相结合，共同加速推动更具竞争力的电动出行发展。</p><section style="text-align: justify;">这一进展不仅标志着零跑在欧洲的本地化量产实现重要突破，也展现了中国新能源汽车企业与欧洲汽车产业携手合作的新路径。</section><section data-type="image" data-ace-gallery-json="{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;21bdb637-95f2-448e-a730-d875387e3d19&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:216.1038961038961,&quot;width&quot;:384,&quot;currHeight&quot;:216.1038961038961,&quot;currWidth&quot;:384,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:780,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1386,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:0.27705627705627706,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream.feishu.cn%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FAT2LbGDO1owYAuxiWC9ct8hYnjf%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;AT2LbGDO1owYAuxiWC9ct8hYnjf&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:1898457,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}" nodeleaf="" style="text-align: center;"><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261020/6ad743a06dcb8.png" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="0.562962962962963" data-type="png" data-w="1080" style="background-color: transparent;width: 100%;" data-width="1386" data-height="780" data-backw="578" data-backh="325" data-imgfileid="504274642" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261020/6ad743a06dcb8.png?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mvfhmj1trrj" data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><section data-mpa-action-id="mr4k8p3w210p" data-pm-slice="5 5 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;data-mpa-powered-by&quot;:&quot;yiban.io&quot;,&quot;data-pm-slice&quot;:&quot;0 0 []&quot;,&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px 0px 24px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family: \&quot;PingFang SC\&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \&quot;Helvetica Neue\&quot;, \&quot;Hiragino Sans GB\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei UI\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei\&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mti9tap9bwj" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><p data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1" style="text-align: justify;"><strong>字节Seed模型评测负责人黄文灏离职</strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p style="text-align: justify;">10月19日消息，据知情人士透露，字节Seed模型评测负责人黄文灏已于近期离职。有消息称，他的下一步动作会是创业，但具体方向和融资情况还不得而知。</p><p style="text-align: justify;">公开信息显示，2024年8月，黄文灏以零一万物联合创始人、算法副总裁及模型训练负责人的身份加入字节Seed团队，担任技术项目管理和规划负责人，向时任Seed负责人的朱文佳汇报。</p><section style="text-align: justify;"><p>2025年初，谷歌DeepMind副总裁吴永辉接手Seed，黄文灏转向吴永辉汇报。此后，黄文灏的主要工作调整为Seed模型评测工作，同时参与一些seed的前沿技术规划讨论和人才招聘。（申妈的朋友圈）</p><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-action-id="mr4k8p3w210p" data-pm-slice="5 5 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;data-mpa-powered-by&quot;:&quot;yiban.io&quot;,&quot;data-pm-slice&quot;:&quot;0 0 []&quot;,&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px 0px 24px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family: \&quot;PingFang SC\&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \&quot;Helvetica Neue\&quot;, \&quot;Hiragino Sans GB\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei UI\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei\&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mti9tap9bwj" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><p data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><strong>MiniMax M3.1 Flash上线：速度提升3倍，价格降低70%</strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p style="text-align: justify;">10月19日晚间消息，MiniMax发布新一代Flash模型M3.1 Flash，宣布此前以匿名身份处理了超过200T Token的Space Bunny模型，正是 MiniMax M3.1 Flash早期版本。</p><p style="text-align: justify;">据悉，作为新一代 Flash 模型，M3.1 Flash 在 Agentic 任务、编程、Computer Use 及网络安全能力等方面实现了代际的提升，同时线上推理速度提升了近 3 倍，使用成本降低了 70%。</p><section style="text-align: justify;"><p>M3.1 Flash 使用了更激进的稀疏注意力架构，日常输出速度可达200+ TPS，中位数（P50）稳定达到170+ TPS。API价格同步下调，每百万tokens输入仅1元、输出4元、缓存读取0.1元。据MiniMax预告，追求更高智能上限的Pro版本将于不久后推出。</p><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-action-id="mr4k8p3w210p" data-pm-slice="5 5 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;data-mpa-powered-by&quot;:&quot;yiban.io&quot;,&quot;data-pm-slice&quot;:&quot;0 0 []&quot;,&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px 0px 24px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family: \&quot;PingFang SC\&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \&quot;Helvetica Neue\&quot;, \&quot;Hiragino Sans GB\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei UI\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei\&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mti9tap9bwj" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><p data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><strong>DeepSeek梁文锋加码物理AI，再投腾讯旧将俞涛</strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p style="text-align: justify;">10月19日消息，媒体近日获悉，前腾讯AI Lab、逐际动力人形机器人基础模型负责人俞涛已开启创业，方向为LLM+具身。据相关人士透露，其公司估值第一轮7000万美金，第二轮2亿美金。除某头部和一线基金参与外，明星大模型公司DeepSeek也赫然在列。</p><p style="text-align: justify;">而几天前就有报道称，DeepSeek拟领投一家名为Winverse AI的机器人AI创业公司。融资规模达到数千万美元，投后估值约4亿美元，美团旗下龙珠投资等机构也可能参与。Winverse AI的创始人，是不久前刚从腾讯离开的计算机视觉科学家胡瀚。</p><section style="text-align: justify;"><p>如果再把时间往前拨两个月，这已经是DeepSeek第三次和机器人发生资本联系。8月，DeepSeek出资1.408亿元参与宇树科技IPO战略配售，并与宇树签订合作协议。目前，多个信源一致表明，梁文锋正在密集接触具身智能创业者，评估的方案既包括亲自组建团队下场研发，也包括通过投资整合切入。（Top华人科创社、爱运营）</p><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-action-id="mr4k8p3w210p" data-pm-slice="5 5 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;data-mpa-powered-by&quot;:&quot;yiban.io&quot;,&quot;data-pm-slice&quot;:&quot;0 0 []&quot;,&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px 0px 24px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family: \&quot;PingFang SC\&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \&quot;Helvetica Neue\&quot;, \&quot;Hiragino Sans GB\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei UI\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei\&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mti9tap9bwj" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><p data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><strong>李想谈电池自研：行业要两条腿走路</strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p style="text-align: justify;">10月19日消息，理想汽车CEO李想在微博发文，为“主机厂自研电池”辩护，称汽车主机厂深入研究电池核心技术“有利于行业发展和消费者利益”。</p><p style="text-align: justify;">李想以个人电脑行业作类比并提出，超大规模产业需要“两条腿交替前进”：一条腿是深入理解产品的专业供应商，另一条腿是深入研究核心技术的整机厂商，“长期只靠一条腿，单脚跳跃是很难走久、走远的”。对应到汽车行业，他的判断是：“这个世界既需要最懂智能电动车的电池企业，也需要最懂电池的智能电动车企业。”</p><section style="text-align: justify;">李想回顾，理想2020年定下自研电池，出发点是“从整车和用户需求出发，和专业伙伴一起推动技术进步”，合作供应商仍是全世界非常优秀的顶级伙伴，“哪些自己做，哪些和伙伴一起做，是不同阶段的不同选择，标准只有一个，哪种方式对用户更好”。他同时宣布，10月20日19:30将举行Power Day理想汽车电动技术发布会，公布最新技术进展。（三言科技）</section><section data-type="image" data-ace-gallery-json="{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;7f40d196-9279-4d50-b063-e7530dbf87cc&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:360.4025157232704,&quot;width&quot;:377,&quot;currHeight&quot;:360.4025157232704,&quot;currWidth&quot;:377,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:760,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:795,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:0.4742138364779874,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream.feishu.cn%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FG03wblqiXoYJF4xXWKDcS9IdnJv%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;G03wblqiXoYJF4xXWKDcS9IdnJv&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:106335,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}" nodeleaf="" style="text-align: center;"><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261020/6ad743a0982b1.png" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="0.9559748427672956" data-type="png" data-w="795" style="background-color: transparent;width: 100%;" data-width="795" data-height="760" data-backw="578" data-backh="553" data-imgfileid="504274638" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261020/6ad743a0982b1.png?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mvfhna2kvml" data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><section data-mpa-action-id="mr4k8p3w210p" data-pm-slice="5 5 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;data-mpa-powered-by&quot;:&quot;yiban.io&quot;,&quot;data-pm-slice&quot;:&quot;0 0 []&quot;,&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px 0px 24px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family: \&quot;PingFang SC\&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \&quot;Helvetica Neue\&quot;, \&quot;Hiragino Sans GB\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei UI\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei\&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mti9tap9bwj" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><p data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1" style="text-align: justify;"><strong>深企响应！拓竹：APEC期间实行错峰上下班或居家办公</strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p style="text-align: justify;">11月18日至19日，亚太经合组织（APEC）第三十三次领导人非正式会议将在深圳举办。为统筹做好外事高标准保障和城市正常运行，深圳倡导全市企业在APEC会议当周工作日期间（11月16日至20日）实行灵活工作安排，可选方式包含居家远程办公、错峰弹性上下班，也可以结合员工意愿统筹安排带薪年休假。</p><p style="text-align: justify;">10月19日，雷峰网从拓竹科技了解到，为保障员工的安全与出行便利，经公司研究决定，APEC周期间，深圳地区各部门可酌情安排错峰上下班或居家办公。</p><section style="text-align: justify;"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-action-id="mr4k8p3w210p" data-pm-slice="5 5 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;data-mpa-powered-by&quot;:&quot;yiban.io&quot;,&quot;data-pm-slice&quot;:&quot;0 0 []&quot;,&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px 0px 24px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family: \&quot;PingFang SC\&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \&quot;Helvetica Neue\&quot;, \&quot;Hiragino Sans GB\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei UI\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei\&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mti9tap9bwj" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><p data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><strong>沐瞳科技向公司全员每人发放5克黄金，总价值近千万，离职也能领</strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p style="text-align: justify;">10月19日消息，近日，沐瞳科技发布通知，兑现年初年会许下的承诺：MLBB十周年「神话之路」24K纯金纪念手链（5克）全部到位，人手一条。</p><p style="text-align: justify;">发放对象包含2026年1月30日当天在职的全球所有员工，覆盖人数超2000人。按每人5克黄金的规格，这批纪念手链黄金总重量达到10公斤，粗略估算物料价值接近千万元。</p><section style="text-align: justify;">同时，据报道，凡是1月30号沐瞳年会在职的员工都有领取资格，也就是说，哪怕后面已经离职了的员工也能领。据悉，人力团队已在9月底发出和离职员工确认领取方式的电子邮件。（鞭牛士、大厂青年）</section><section data-type="image" data-ace-gallery-json="{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;e7ae8e6b-8f0a-49fe-a575-b897f7f44abf&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:231.23977695167287,&quot;width&quot;:414,&quot;currHeight&quot;:231.23977695167287,&quot;currWidth&quot;:414,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:601,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1076,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:0.3847583643122677,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream.feishu.cn%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FQDx5bb2ANouO5CxvClacI8wsnad%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;QDx5bb2ANouO5CxvClacI8wsnad&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image/jpeg&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:59890,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}" nodeleaf="" style="text-align: center;"><strong><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261020/6ad743a0c32da.jpg" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="0.5585501858736059" data-type="jpeg" data-w="1076" style="background-color: transparent;" data-width="1076" data-height="601" data-imgfileid="504274644" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261020/6ad743a0c32da.jpg?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></strong></section><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mvfhocerw0v" data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><section data-mpa-action-id="mr4k8p3w210p" data-pm-slice="5 5 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;data-mpa-powered-by&quot;:&quot;yiban.io&quot;,&quot;data-pm-slice&quot;:&quot;0 0 []&quot;,&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px 0px 24px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family: \&quot;PingFang SC\&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \&quot;Helvetica Neue\&quot;, \&quot;Hiragino Sans GB\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei UI\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei\&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mti9tap9bwj" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><p data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1" style="text-align: justify;"><strong>商标落定！小米行政豪华车SU9 LUX要来了？</strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p style="text-align: justify;">10月19日消息，最新的商标公告显示，小米科技有限责任公司申请的“XIAOMI SU9 LUX”商标，已进入初步审定阶段。商标资料显示，该商标申请时间为2026年2月13日，归属第12类运输工具，是汽车产品对应的商标类别。</p><p style="text-align: justify;">从这款车的命名逻辑来看，XIAOMI SU9 LUX里的LUX，是英文LUXURY的缩写，代表豪华。爆料信息称，新车车长有望达到5.2米。也有市场消息称，小米SU9 LUX就是此前网络曝光的小米SU7L测试车，新车有望定位行政级豪华轿车市场，网传起售价预计突破40万元，直接对标奥迪A6L、享界S9，以及宝马5系、奔驰E级等传统豪华品牌中大型轿车。</p><section style="text-align: justify;">此前，小米在股东大会、业绩沟通会等多个场合披露，小米汽车2026年规划推出四款新车，产品矩阵包含SU7改款车型、行政级轿车，以及两款增程SUV。从小米汽车现有产品矩阵规划来看，SU7主打运动轿跑市场，YU7定位SUV，澎程系列面向家庭大空间需求，SU9 LUX大概率要冲的是行政豪华这条线。（电车界）</section><section data-type="image" data-ace-gallery-json="{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;b2c4b0d5-b215-4b41-b241-1c560c4d6134&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:268.9555555555555,&quot;width&quot;:588,&quot;currHeight&quot;:268.9555555555555,&quot;currWidth&quot;:588,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:494,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1080,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:0.5444444444444444,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream.feishu.cn%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FHI9WbKpf7oPEepxC7P7c1ononse%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;HI9WbKpf7oPEepxC7P7c1ononse&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:169562,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}" nodeleaf="" style="text-align: center;"><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261020/6ad743a102c82.png" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="0.45740740740740743" data-type="png" data-w="1080" style="background-color: transparent;width: 100%;" data-width="1080" data-height="494" data-backw="578" data-backh="264" data-imgfileid="504274643" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261020/6ad743a102c82.png?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mvfhomepfpu" data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><section data-mpa-action-id="mr4k8p3w210p" data-pm-slice="5 5 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;data-mpa-powered-by&quot;:&quot;yiban.io&quot;,&quot;data-pm-slice&quot;:&quot;0 0 []&quot;,&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px 0px 24px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family: \&quot;PingFang SC\&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \&quot;Helvetica Neue\&quot;, \&quot;Hiragino Sans GB\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei UI\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei\&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mti9tap9bwj" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><p data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1" style="text-align: justify;"><strong>阿里：玄铁芯片目前已经稳定出货超60亿颗</strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section style="text-align: justify;"><p>10月19日消息，据报道，2026 RISC-V中国峰会上，阿里达摩院首席科学家孟建熠表示：迄今，玄铁芯片目前已经稳定出货超60亿颗。根据机构预测，至2030年，全球RISC-V处理器年度出货量每年增长近30%，2030年在全球处理器出货份额将达到约25%的市场占有率。阿里达摩院还在会上发布首个车规增强E908A芯片。（科创板日报）</p><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-action-id="mr4k8p3w210p" data-pm-slice="5 5 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;data-mpa-powered-by&quot;:&quot;yiban.io&quot;,&quot;data-pm-slice&quot;:&quot;0 0 []&quot;,&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px 0px 24px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family: \&quot;PingFang SC\&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \&quot;Helvetica Neue\&quot;, \&quot;Hiragino Sans GB\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei UI\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei\&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mti9tap9bwj" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><p data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><strong>iQOO产品经理邢程宣布离职：曾参与打造Z系列多款机型</strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p style="text-align: justify;">10月19日消息，iQOO Z系列产品经理邢程（微博昵称“行走的橙子Q”）通过个人微博宣布，自己已从vivo离职。</p><p style="text-align: justify;">邢程发文表示：“各位酷客朋友们，我已经离开蓝厂了，也想好好跟大家告个别。”邢程同时明确，未来“行走的橙子”不再代表任何公司和产品，但自己依然会支持和关注iQOO，对数码产品的热爱也不会改变。</p><p style="text-align: justify;">据了解，邢程此前担任iQOO Z系列产品经理，曾参与iQOO Z11 Turbo、iQOO Z11等多款机型的打造与发布。对于此次离职，有网友在评论区留言：“还说等你发布新机呢。”邢程则回复称：“天下没有不散的宴席，继续关注哦，明年的产品会有惊喜的。”（快科技）</p><section data-type="image" data-ace-gallery-json="{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;5d05fa50-0c90-4af0-8cf4-a5b3a1319c31&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:341.99999999999994,&quot;width&quot;:341.99999999999994,&quot;currHeight&quot;:341.99999999999994,&quot;currWidth&quot;:341.99999999999994,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:600,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:600,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:0.57,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream.feishu.cn%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FKXt1b8YLDoFRfXx4CRrcdKXenud%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;KXt1b8YLDoFRfXx4CRrcdKXenud&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image/jpeg&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:158485,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}" nodeleaf="" style="text-align: center;"><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261020/6ad743a11cf24.jpg" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="1" data-type="jpeg" data-w="600" style="background-color: transparent;width: 100%;" data-width="600" data-height="600" data-backw="578" data-backh="578" data-imgfileid="504274645" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261020/6ad743a11cf24.jpg?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mvfhoypv209i" data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><section data-mpa-action-id="mr4k8p3w210p" data-pm-slice="5 5 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;data-mpa-powered-by&quot;:&quot;yiban.io&quot;,&quot;data-pm-slice&quot;:&quot;0 0 []&quot;,&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px 0px 24px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family: \&quot;PingFang SC\&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \&quot;Helvetica Neue\&quot;, \&quot;Hiragino Sans GB\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei UI\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei\&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mti9tap9bwj" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><p data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1" style="text-align: justify;"><strong>快狗打车拟1元出售中国内地业务</strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p style="text-align: justify;">10月19日消息，日前，快狗打车发布公告称，与买方Crestpoint Investment Limited订立买卖协议，拟以人民币1.00元出售目标公司GGEx Holdings Limited的全部已发行股本。目标集团主要承载快狗打车在中国内地的物流及配送业务。同时，董事会建议将公司中文名称由“快狗打车控股有限公司”更改为“GOGO科技”，英文名称维持不变。</p><p style="text-align: justify;">出售完成后，集团将不再以“快狗打车”品牌在中国内地经营业务，业务重心转为香港及其他海外市场的“GOGOX”品牌，现有中文名称已不再反映业务及未来战略方向。</p><section style="text-align: justify;">公告显示，目标集团截至2026年6月30日止六个月收入约4401.6万元，净亏损约4925.9万元，于2026年6月30日录得负债净额约247.6万元。由于适用百分比率超过25%但低于75%，出售事项构成上市规则下的主要交易，须经股东批准。完成后，目标集团财务业绩将不再综合入账至公司报表，预计确认出售收益约247.6万元，但实际金额取决于交割日估值。（三言科技）</section><section data-type="image" data-ace-gallery-json="{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;5cd9f976-6f96-4e14-8ece-c6e8496fa62a&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:289.63114754098365,&quot;width&quot;:382,&quot;currHeight&quot;:289.63114754098365,&quot;currWidth&quot;:382,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:740,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:976,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:0.39139344262295084,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream.feishu.cn%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FKEBYbSNTbo850mxOeKbc0xPknBe%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;KEBYbSNTbo850mxOeKbc0xPknBe&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:176765,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}" nodeleaf="" style="text-align: center;"><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261020/6ad743a153e4a.png" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="0.7581967213114754" data-type="png" data-w="976" style="background-color: transparent;width: 100%;" data-width="976" data-height="740" data-backw="578" data-backh="438" data-imgfileid="504274646" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261020/6ad743a153e4a.png?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section></section></section><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mbam15q08cj"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-style-type="5" data-id="745895" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section mpa-from-tpl="t"><section mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-role="title" data-tools="135编辑器" data-id="107772" data-color="#ee5b2e" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section mpa-from-tpl="t"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" nodeleaf=""></section><section mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-brushtype="text" hm_fix="325:484" mpa-from-tpl="t" style="text-align: center;"><span style="font-size: 24px;"><strong>国际资讯</strong></span></section><section data-width="100%" mpa-from-tpl="t"><br/></section></section></section></section></section></section><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-action-id="mr4k8p3w210p" data-pm-slice="5 5 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;data-mpa-powered-by&quot;:&quot;yiban.io&quot;,&quot;data-pm-slice&quot;:&quot;0 0 []&quot;,&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px 0px 24px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family: \&quot;PingFang SC\&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \&quot;Helvetica Neue\&quot;, \&quot;Hiragino Sans GB\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei UI\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei\&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mti9tap9bwj" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><p data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1" style="text-align: justify;"><strong>马斯克：明年向全美儿童赠送 SpaceX 股票</strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p style="text-align: justify;">10 月 19 日消息，埃隆 · 马斯克在社交平台发布置顶消息，将在明年把自己的 SpaceX 股票送给美国的每个孩子，而这只是开始。同日，SpaceX股价报146.03美元，总市值约1.92万亿美元。</p><p style="text-align: justify;">此前报道，美国亿万富翁埃隆・马斯克一直提倡多生孩子，自己也身体力行成为了十多个孩子的父亲（最新爆料为14个）。他曾敦促意大利和其他发达国家的人们生育更多孩子，否则像意大利、日本和法国这样的国家文化可能会消失。</p><section style="text-align: justify;">马斯克的前女友、美国保守派评论人士阿什莉 · 圣克莱尔（Ashley St Clair）透露，马斯克曾发短信告诉她，希望在“内战爆发前拥有一大批孩子”。（IT之家）</section><section data-type="image" data-ace-gallery-json="{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;bc270a31-ffa0-4d3f-808e-122b287530a5&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:259.7382297551789,&quot;width&quot;:427,&quot;currHeight&quot;:259.7382297551789,&quot;currWidth&quot;:427,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:323,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:531,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:0.8041431261770244,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream.feishu.cn%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FXy7PbnQ6Zo1qfTxfw5EcRWrKnhe%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;Xy7PbnQ6Zo1qfTxfw5EcRWrKnhe&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:95799,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}" nodeleaf="" style="text-align: center;"><strong><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261020/6ad743a199138.png" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="0.608286252354049" data-type="png" data-w="531" style="background-color: transparent;width: 100%;" data-width="531" data-height="323" data-backw="531" data-backh="323" data-imgfileid="504274648" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261020/6ad743a199138.png?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></strong></section><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mvfx5o8p11af" data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><section data-mpa-action-id="mr4k8p3w210p" data-pm-slice="5 5 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;data-mpa-powered-by&quot;:&quot;yiban.io&quot;,&quot;data-pm-slice&quot;:&quot;0 0 []&quot;,&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px 0px 24px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family: \&quot;PingFang SC\&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \&quot;Helvetica Neue\&quot;, \&quot;Hiragino Sans GB\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei UI\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei\&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mti9tap9bwj" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><p data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1" style="text-align: justify;"><strong>OpenAI拟融资300亿美元 估值或超1.4万亿美元</strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p style="text-align: justify;">10 月 19 日消息，据报道，OpenAI正加快推进一轮约300亿美元的融资，目标估值可能超过1.4万亿美元，并希望赶在竞争对手Anthropic预计于11月中旬上市前获得投资者承诺。软银集团、阿布扎比投资机构MGX及其他现有投资者正洽谈参与本轮融资。</p><p style="text-align: justify;">OpenAI向投资者表示，其年化营收在推出GPT-6 Astra模型后加速增长，目前已达500亿美元，预计年底升至700亿美元。公司希望在Anthropic披露更多财务信息、引发投资者进一步比较之前完成融资。OpenAI今年3月在一轮1220亿美元融资后估值达到8520亿美元。（科创板日报）</p><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mvfhsugq1ncw" data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><section data-mpa-action-id="mr4k8p3w210p" data-pm-slice="5 5 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;data-mpa-powered-by&quot;:&quot;yiban.io&quot;,&quot;data-pm-slice&quot;:&quot;0 0 []&quot;,&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px 0px 24px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family: \&quot;PingFang SC\&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \&quot;Helvetica Neue\&quot;, \&quot;Hiragino Sans GB\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei UI\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei\&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mti9tap9bwj" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><p data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1" style="text-align: justify;"><strong>古尔曼：苹果正研发室内摄像头，依靠 AI 分析环境</strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p style="text-align: justify;">10 月 19 日消息，外媒记者马克 · 古尔曼在最新一期《Power On》通讯中提到，苹果正在研发一款室内摄像头，内部代号 J450，可利用 AI 分析周围环境。</p><p style="text-align: justify;">据了解，这款摄像头拥有低帧率传感器和红外传感器，支持人脸识别等技术，以识别人员或宠物。用户将收到周围环境的文字描述，而非视频画面。该产品的核心设计理念似乎与隐私保护有关，无法录制家里的私密场景。</p><section style="text-align: justify;">古尔曼认为，这款摄像头预计将在明年某个时候推出。同时，该产品并不属于 10 月 13 日公布的 Home Collection 系列配件。此外，苹果可能还会观察 Home Collection 系列产品的销售情况，再决定是否推出自有品牌智能家居硬件。（IT之家）</section><section data-type="image" data-ace-gallery-json="{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;4ea8f5ff-51c0-4266-a972-b828500a716d&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:246.54658385093168,&quot;width&quot;:446,&quot;currHeight&quot;:246.54658385093168,&quot;currWidth&quot;:446,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:534,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:966,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:0.4616977225672878,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream.feishu.cn%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FUNC9b5I5foWA6NxPdkicNbtfnIb%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;UNC9b5I5foWA6NxPdkicNbtfnIb&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:539781,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}" nodeleaf="" style="text-align: center;"><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261020/6ad743a1e0038.png" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="0.5527950310559007" data-type="png" data-w="966" style="background-color: transparent;width: 100%;" data-width="966" data-height="534" data-backw="578" data-backh="320" data-imgfileid="504274649" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261020/6ad743a1e0038.png?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mvfhsjmv6x4" data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><section data-mpa-action-id="mr4k8p3w210p" data-pm-slice="5 5 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;data-mpa-powered-by&quot;:&quot;yiban.io&quot;,&quot;data-pm-slice&quot;:&quot;0 0 []&quot;,&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px 0px 24px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family: \&quot;PingFang SC\&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \&quot;Helvetica Neue\&quot;, \&quot;Hiragino Sans GB\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei UI\&quot;, \&quot;Microsoft YaHei\&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;},&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;section&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mti9tap9bwj" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section powered-by="xiumi.us" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1"><p data-doubao-translate-traverse-mark="1" style="text-align: justify;"><strong>特斯拉披露：马斯克2025年股权激励薪酬达1583.6亿美元</strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p style="text-align: justify;">10月19日消息，特斯拉披露，埃隆·马斯克2025年薪酬为价值1583.6亿美元（约合人民币1.058万亿元）的股票奖励。</p><section style="text-align: justify;">其中1323亿美元，为2025年度CEO绩效奖励的授予日公允价值，前提是全部业绩考核目标达成；另外260.6亿美元，是2025年度CEO过渡奖励的授予日公允价值，该笔奖励已于2026年4月全部作废。（新浪科技）</section><section data-type="image" data-ace-gallery-json="{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;a62b6851-b173-4210-b3a5-c7a12572212a&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:410,&quot;width&quot;:964,&quot;currHeight&quot;:410,&quot;currWidth&quot;:964,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:410,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:964,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream.feishu.cn%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FFOeSb33CHoDzaJxWhWDcdP4YnQh%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;FOeSb33CHoDzaJxWhWDcdP4YnQh&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:80560,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}" nodeleaf="" style="text-align: center;"><img  class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-aistatus="1" data-backh="246" data-backw="578" data-height="410" data-imgfileid="504274647" data-ratio="0.42531120331950206" data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261020/6ad743a214ade.png" data-type="png" data-w="964" data-width="964" style="background-color: transparent;width: 100%;"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261020/6ad743a214ade.png?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section></section></section><p style="text-align: justify;"><mp-style-type data-value="3"></mp-style-type><mp-style-type data-value="3"></mp-style-type></p>]]></description>
