<pubDate>Tue, 20 Oct 2026 18:39:00 +0800</pubDate>
</item>
<item>
<title>喊出300万张订单，英伟达RTX PRO 5500为何遭到提前疯抢？</title>
<link>https://www.leiphone.com/category/chips/STx9ZzfDNh5W80Bm.html</link>
<description><![CDATA[<section data-mpa-powered-by="yiban.io" data-pm-slice="0 0 []" style="-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px 0px 24px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family: &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;"><section style="-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;"><section style="-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;"><section style="-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;" data-mpa-action-id="mr4k8p3w210p" data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><section style="text-align: center;" nodeleaf=""><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261020/6ad741c4ec651.png" class="rich_pages wxw-img js_insertlocalimg" data-ratio="0.18" data-s="300,640" data-type="png" data-w="1000" style="width:100%;" type="block" data-backw="578" data-backh="104" data-imgfileid="504268953" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261020/6ad741c4ec651.png?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-from-tpl="t" style="-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;letter-spacing: 0.544px;visibility: visible;" data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" style="-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px 0px -10px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);letter-spacing: 0px;text-align: right;line-height: 25.6px;visibility: visible;"></section></section><section style="margin-top: 16px;"><section data-mpa-action-id="mvasrsnde2g" data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;margin-top: 24px;"><span leaf="" mpa-font-style="mvasrsn1g1l" style="font-size: 15px; font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0.5px;">在AI算力市场，等风声传开再下注，往往已经慢了半拍。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" mpa-font-style="mvasrsn11hmo" style="font-size: 15px; font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0.5px;">早在8月份，服务器产品经理夏寅卿已经开始向客户推介还未面世的RTX PRO 5500。一个月后，这张最新PRO系列专业工作站显卡才默默出现在英伟达官网。</span></section><section style="text-align: center;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;" data-type="image" data-ace-gallery-json="{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;93dfc144-439c-492c-be3d-b7d261fd2c5b&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:417.83083219645295,&quot;width&quot;:820.0000000000001,&quot;currHeight&quot;:417.83083219645295,&quot;currWidth&quot;:820.0000000000001,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:1494,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:2932,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:0.27967257844474763,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream.feishu.cn%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FCoH3bdt68ood0Lxly79cPXKInse%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;CoH3bdt68ood0Lxly79cPXKInse&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:1666711,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}" nodeleaf=""><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261020/6ad741c534997.png" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="0.509375" data-type="png" data-w="2560" style="background-color: transparent;width: 100%;" data-width="2932" data-height="1494" data-backw="578" data-backh="294" data-imgfileid="504274588" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261020/6ad741c534997.png?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" mpa-font-style="mvasrsn124m6" style="font-size: 15px; font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0.5px;">然而，RTX PRO 5500在中国市场引发的动静，远不如它正式亮相时那般低调——有大厂被传计划采购100万张；跨界布局算力租赁的天阳科技，签订2万张采购合同的消息经公众号平台发布当天，股价上涨12.38%。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" mpa-font-style="mvasrsn124m6" style="font-size: 15px; font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0.5px;">夏寅卿用“疯狂”来形容国内采购热潮，称订购规模已达数百万张，接近英伟达预计的全球产能。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" mpa-font-style="mvasrsn1naf" style="font-size: 15px; font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0.5px;">与此同时，这张尚未批量交付，实际性能也有待验证的新卡，还被卷入了另一张热门显卡的停产风波。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" mpa-font-style="mvasrsn11iiy" style="font-size: 15px; font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0.5px;">有海外社媒爆料称，英伟达计划将GB202芯片的后续供应转向包含RTX PRO 5500在内的RTX PRO系列，不再向旗舰游戏显卡RTX 5090分配芯片产能。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" mpa-font-style="mvasrsn11iiy" style="font-size: 15px; font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0.5px;">消息尚未得到英伟达正式确认，但价格本就水涨船高的5090，国内部分渠道报价已进一步攀升至5.7万元左右。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" mpa-font-style="mvasrsn1ewr" style="font-size: 15px; font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0.5px;">一边是新卡尚未交付，买家已经争相下注；另一边，现有的专业卡、消费级显卡的供需和价格也被推到了新的风口。英伟达非数据中心卡在中国的生意将迎来哪些转变？</span><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-from-tpl="t" style="margin-bottom: 24px;outline: 0px;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-align: justify;"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-from-tpl="t" style="outline: 0px;"><section data-role="paragraph" mpa-from-tpl="t" style="outline: 0px;"><section data-role="title" data-tools="135编辑器" data-id="94063" mpa-from-tpl="t" style="outline: 0px;"><section hm_fix="374:463" mpa-from-tpl="t" style="padding-top: 10px;padding-bottom: 10px;outline: 0px;text-align: center;"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" style="outline: 0px;display: inline-block;"><section data-bgless="spin" data-bglessp="280" mpa-from-tpl="t" style="margin-bottom: -22px;outline: 0px;height: 8px;background: rgb(238, 92, 47);border-radius: 6px;overflow: hidden;margin-top: 24px;"><span leaf=""><br/></span></section><section mpa-from-tpl="t" style="margin-right: auto;margin-left: auto;padding-right: 10px;padding-left: 10px;outline: 0px;display: inline-block;height: 35px;color: rgb(63, 63, 63);line-height: 35px;font-size: 30px;transform: rotate(0deg);"><strong mpa-from-tpl="t" style="outline: 0px;" mpa-is-content="t"><span leaf="">01<br/></span></strong></section></section></section><h4 style="outline: 0px;font-weight: 400;font-size: 16px;text-align: center;visibility: visible;letter-spacing: 0.544px;line-height: 1.6em;"><strong mpa-from-tpl="t" style="outline: 0px;visibility: visible;"><span style="outline: 0px; color: #EE5B2E; visibility: visible;" mpa-is-content="t">合规之外，5500</span><p style="outline: 0px;visibility: visible;"><span style="outline: 0px; color: #EE5B2E; visibility: visible;" mpa-is-content="t">还有哪些值得被争抢的筹码？</span></p></strong></h4></section></section></section></section></section></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" mpa-font-style="mvasrsn1xys" style="font-size: 15px; font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0.5px;">合规，是部分中国企业采购英伟达GPU时首先要锚定的必要条件。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" mpa-font-style="mvasrsn11jz7" style="font-size: 15px; font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0.5px;">“英伟达将RTX PRO 5500定位为专业工作站GPU，是为了更容易通过相关审批。”智算中心服务商老林直言。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" mpa-font-style="mvasrsn11jz7" style="font-size: 15px; font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0.5px;">相较上一代RTX PRO 6000分化出服务器版、工作站版等版本，从英伟达目前公开的信息看，这一次的RTX PRO 5500只押注一条线。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" mpa-font-style="mvasrsn1abj" style="font-size: 15px; font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0.5px;">在RTX PRO 5500之前，为了应对美国商务部工业与安全局（BIS）等相关部门对先进计算芯片的管制，英伟达陆续推出面向中国市场的特供型号，围绕计算能力、显存带宽等指标做出取舍。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" mpa-font-style="mvasrsn16km" style="font-size: 15px; font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0.5px;">RTX PRO 6000D就是其中一个典例。基于几位受访者提供的参数，在常用的AI计算精度下，这款特供产品的算力仅占RTX PRO 6000服务器版的三至四成。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span mpa-font-style="mvasrsn1ebj" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span leaf="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">有RTX PRO 6000D的性能大幅缩水在前，目前暂未声明有特供型号的RTX PRO 5500算力表现是否也会大打折扣，自然备受关注。结合官方理论参数和夏寅卿给到的数据，在FP4、FP8等精度下，</span><strong><span leaf="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">RTX PRO 5500的理论算力较RTX PRO 6000D提升约一倍。</span></strong></span></section><section style="text-align: center;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;" data-type="image" data-ace-gallery-json="{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;4819ab50-c019-4106-8b4f-8d5e9f707c10&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:680,&quot;width&quot;:1448,&quot;currHeight&quot;:680,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1448,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:680,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1448,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream.feishu.cn%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FDKgnbav6OoGi8rxajxLcPvYpnkh%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;DKgnbav6OoGi8rxajxLcPvYpnkh&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:135544,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}" nodeleaf=""><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261020/6ad741c55ee48.png" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="0.4696132596685083" data-type="png" data-w="1448" style="background-color: transparent;width: 100%;" data-width="1448" data-height="680" data-backw="578" data-backh="271" data-imgfileid="504274586" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261020/6ad741c55ee48.png?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span mpa-font-style="mvasrsn11omg" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span leaf="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">除此之外，接近英伟达的算力服务从业者秦宇还关注到RTX PRO 5500支持</span><strong><span leaf="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">MIG</span></strong><span leaf="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">（Multi-Instance GPU，多实例GPU）功能，这也是他眼中RTX PRO 5500相较于RTX PRO 6000D的一项重要优势。</span></span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" mpa-font-style="mvasrsn11uhy" style="font-size: 15px; font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0.5px;">根据官方介绍，拥有RTX PRO 6000D同等显存容量的RTX PRO 5500，可以通过MIG划分出两个各含42GB显存的计算板块，不同的AI推理任务可以在同一张GPU上独立运行，提高了算力资源利用率。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" mpa-font-style="mvasrsn11aif" style="font-size: 15px; font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0.5px;">而RTX PRO 5500 84GB的显存容量，本身也有着不小的吸引力。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span mpa-font-style="mvasrsn14ck" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span leaf="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">夏寅卿观察到，</span><strong><span leaf="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">大显存专业GPU的行情今年明显升温</span></strong><span leaf="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">。以RTX PRO 6000服务器版为例，其渠道价格在去年年底经历一轮下跌后，已从今年年初的6万元至7万元涨至18万元至19万元。</span></span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" mpa-font-style="mvasrsn1206z" style="font-size: 15px; font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0.5px;">市场对大显存的渴求甚至催生了民间改装生意——9月深圳曾传出32GB显存的RTX 5090被“魔改”为96GB版本的消息。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" mpa-font-style="mvasrsn1ey0" style="font-size: 15px; font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0.5px;">在夏寅卿看来，这与此前尚未充分释放的终端需求开始爆发有关。随着具身智能、智能驾驶等应用的发展，以及大模型部署需求的增加，部分场景已经走向商业闭环。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" mpa-font-style="mvasrsn11pt8" style="font-size: 15px; font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0.5px;">但终端需求再旺盛、业务再怎么闭环，采购成本仍是绕不开的一笔账。目前，市面上RTX PRO 5500预期交付报价集中在8万元至12万元区间。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" mpa-font-style="mvasrsn11pt8" style="font-size: 15px; font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0.5px;">其中，专注于4090、5090算力服务的Jack透露，其了解到的大厂采购报价约为8.5万元，部分渠道报价升至8.7万元。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span mpa-font-style="mvasrsn1mao" style="font-size: 15px; font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0.5px;">满足正规采购要求、大显存、尚有竞争力的理论算力，再加上大客户预报价接近RTX PRO 6000服务器版当前渠道价的一半，买家提前锁定货源的行为就不难理解。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span mpa-font-style="mvasrsn1mao" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span leaf="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">秦宇了解到，当前国内RTX PRO 5500的订购规模已超过</span><strong><span leaf="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">300万张</span></strong><span leaf="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">，而英伟达每季度向中国市场供应的上限实际上只有50万张。</span></span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" mpa-font-style="mvasrsn11317" style="font-size: 15px; font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0.5px;">有关具体交付时间，根据外媒援引知情人士的报道，英伟达计划从今年12月底开始向中国市场交付RTX PRO 5500。而Jack从渠道获得的消息则更为乐观，称最快11月月底便可能开始交付。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span mpa-font-style="mvasrsn1ih3" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span leaf="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">而夏寅卿则了解到，与英伟达建立OEM合作关系的所有头部服务器厂商将在11月拿到样品卡，随后还需要完成测试和服务器适配。按照他的判断，</span><strong><span leaf="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">正式批量交付最快也要等到明年第一季度。</span></strong></span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span mpa-font-style="mvasrsn1e1s" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span leaf="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">而在这小半年的空窗期里，留给英伟达现有GPU市场的，究竟是千载难逢的机会，还是提前到来的危机？（更多市场观察，欢迎添加作者&nbsp;</span><strong><span leaf="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">Evelynn7778&nbsp;</span></strong><span leaf="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">一起探讨。）</span></span><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-from-tpl="t" style="margin-bottom: 24px;outline: 0px;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-align: justify;"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-from-tpl="t" style="outline: 0px;"><section data-role="paragraph" mpa-from-tpl="t" style="outline: 0px;"><section data-role="title" data-tools="135编辑器" data-id="94063" mpa-from-tpl="t" style="outline: 0px;"><section hm_fix="374:463" mpa-from-tpl="t" style="padding-top: 10px;padding-bottom: 10px;outline: 0px;text-align: center;"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" style="outline: 0px;display: inline-block;"><section data-bgless="spin" data-bglessp="280" mpa-from-tpl="t" style="margin-bottom: -22px;outline: 0px;height: 8px;background: rgb(238, 92, 47);border-radius: 6px;overflow: hidden;margin-top: 24px;"><span leaf=""><br/></span></section><section mpa-from-tpl="t" style="margin-right: auto;margin-left: auto;padding-right: 10px;padding-left: 10px;outline: 0px;display: inline-block;height: 35px;color: rgb(63, 63, 63);line-height: 35px;font-size: 30px;transform: rotate(0deg);"><strong mpa-from-tpl="t" style="outline: 0px;" mpa-is-content="t"><span leaf="">02<br/></span></strong></section></section></section><h4 style="outline: 0px;font-weight: 400;font-size: 16px;text-align: center;visibility: visible;letter-spacing: 0.544px;line-height: 1.6em;"><strong mpa-from-tpl="t" style="outline: 0px;visibility: visible;"><span style="outline: 0px; color: #EE5B2E; visibility: visible;" mpa-is-content="t">6000D回落至7万元</span></strong></h4></section><section data-role="title" data-tools="135编辑器" data-id="94063" mpa-from-tpl="t" style="outline: 0px;"><h4 style="outline: 0px;font-weight: 400;font-size: 16px;text-align: center;visibility: visible;letter-spacing: 0.544px;line-height: 1.6em;"><strong mpa-from-tpl="t" style="outline: 0px;visibility: visible;"><span style="outline: 0px; color: #EE5B2E; visibility: visible;" mpa-is-content="t">5090涨破5万元，5500会改变谁的行情？</span></strong></h4></section></section></section></section></section></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" mpa-font-style="mvasrsn1hi4" style="font-size: 15px; font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0.5px;">相较于一年前，RTX PRO 6000D如今的市场境遇有所改善。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" mpa-font-style="mvasrsn110vy" style="font-size: 15px; font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0.5px;">彼时，大型买家仍在观望H20、B30A等产品的供应进展，由于本身性价比不足，这款顶着“合规”名头的小卡并未获得青睐。进入2026年，曾经不被看好的特供卡渠道报价已从年中约5万元涨至8月的7万元以上，之后虽有所回落，但仍维持在7万元左右。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" mpa-font-style="mvasrsn11dq0" style="font-size: 15px; font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0.5px;">有海外GPU供应经验的小岚认为，经过专业团队调优，RTX PRO 6000D在部分场景中的实际表现可以接近RTX PRO 6000。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span mpa-font-style="mvasrsn11fhd" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span leaf="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">做服务器生意的David则提醒，评判性能表现，得从具体业务出发。如果场景主要依赖显存容量和带宽，两款产品的实际差距可能并不明显；但显卡应用于</span><strong><span leaf="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">计算密集型任务，靠调优来弥补早被削减的差距，终究有上限。</span></strong></span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span mpa-font-style="mvasrsn11cgx" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span leaf="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">当理论算力更高、同样拥有84GB显存的RTX PRO 5500即将入场，属于同系列的RTX PRO 6000D是否会停产？现有的价格还能维持多久？更多信息可联系作者&nbsp;</span><strong><span leaf="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">Evelynn7778&nbsp;</span></strong><span leaf="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">讨论。</span></span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" mpa-font-style="mvasrsn11z8l" style="font-size: 15px; font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0.5px;">RTX PRO 5500的到来，还牵动着5090的命运。有媒体统计主流电商平台上的售价，当前5090价格已突破5万元，一个月内涨幅超50%。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" mpa-font-style="mvasrsn1gvm" style="font-size: 15px; font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0.5px;">涨价背后的原因难以一概而论，但5090的货源紧张，早在近期的停产传闻出现前就已有迹可循。夏寅卿透露，数月前，部分与英伟达有合作的显卡厂商，能够供应的5090就已十分有限。而中间贸易商的囤货惜售，进一步加剧了市场的紧张情绪。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" mpa-font-style="mvasrsn1kcm" style="font-size: 15px; font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0.5px;">偏偏此时，GB202产能可能重新分配的爆料又在国内外互联网中疯传，5090若真面临减产甚至停产，眼下的高价恐怕还不是终点。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span mpa-font-style="mvasrsn12fx" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span leaf="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">不过，对于是否停产的判断，雷峰网所交流的数位受访者有所分歧：一方认为，</span><strong><span leaf="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">AI业务带来的收益远超游戏</span></strong><span leaf="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">，英伟达有理由将更多芯片资源向专业GPU倾斜；另一方则指出，在下一代消费级旗舰显卡问世前，5090仍承担着维持英伟达高端消费级产品定位的角色，</span><strong><span leaf="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">大幅减产比彻底停产更有可能。</span></strong></span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" mpa-font-style="mvasrsn11wmf" style="font-size: 15px; font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0.5px;">此外，新一轮的涨价并非没有天花板。Jack指出，一路上涨的单卡价格，并未同步传导至服务器租赁市场。他所了解到的月租报价仅从约1.3万元涨至不足1.5万元。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span mpa-font-style="mvasrsn1hqq" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span leaf="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">而RTX PRO 5500的入场也可能同时从需求端戳破5090的价格泡沫。按照目前的预报价，</span><strong><span leaf="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">一张RTX PRO 5500的价格已接近两张5090，显存容量却超过后者之和。</span></strong></span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" mpa-font-style="mvasrsn11sp3" style="font-size: 15px; font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0.5px;">对于有大显存需求或者需要合规采购的客户而言，RTX PRO 5500的吸引力不容小觑。一旦部分买家选择采购或租赁RTX PRO 5500，5090的紧俏行情或将松动，价格也可能随之回落。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span mpa-font-style="mvasrsn1rku" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><strong><span leaf="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">RTX PRO 5500可能动摇的，还有一批服务器厂商靠5090建立起来的竞争优势</span></strong><span leaf="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">。</span></span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span mpa-font-style="mvasrsn1rku" style="font-size: 15px; font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0.5px;">David介绍，此前部分与英伟达建立OEM合作关系的服务器厂商在相关要求下很难推出搭载5090的服务器。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span mpa-font-style="mvasrsn1rku" style="font-size: 15px; font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0.5px;">一些不受限的厂商则抓住了这个空当，通过使用改装后的5090显卡，或专门设计能够容纳原装5090的服务器，在这一市场做出了差异化。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" mpa-font-style="mvasrsn11t70" style="font-size: 15px; font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0.5px;">但随着RTX PRO 5500这类可直接用于企业级机架部署的专业GPU上市，所有厂商都有机会通过标准服务器承接相关推理需求。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" mpa-font-style="mvasrsn11t70" style="font-size: 15px; font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0.5px;">David坦言，这意味着5090服务器厂商曾经依靠错位竞争建立的竞争优势可能会被削弱，接下来不得不在更大的服务器市场里比拼价格、客户关系和服务等。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" mpa-font-style="mvasrsn11ejg" style="font-size: 15px; font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0.5px;">至于这场竞争究竟会有多激烈，还得看RTX PRO 5500交付后的实际表现。</span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span mpa-font-style="mvasrsn1a8b" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span leaf="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px; font-weight: bold;">关于接下来AI服务器生意的冷暖与变数，欢迎与作者&nbsp;</span><strong><span leaf="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px; font-weight: bold;">Evelynn7778&nbsp;</span></strong><span leaf="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px; font-weight: bold;">交流。</span></span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" mpa-font-style="mvasz4q3ncn" style="font-size: 12px; font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0.5px; color: #888888;" data-mpa-action-id="mvasz4qa1tkp" data-pm-slice="0 0 []">* 文中受访者均为匿名</span></section></section><section style="text-align: center;margin-bottom: 0px;margin-top: 32px;" nodeleaf=""><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261020/6ad741c5b618f.png" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="1.228" data-s="300,640" data-type="png" data-w="1000" style="width: 100%;background-color: transparent;" data-croporisrc="https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/ACzflXDibhg6rm9QEHs7ZZiaVF9OfDjntpq3eU3Jjwghe8BzZRRafdZqRxG4SOEvd05UKiarqJ6BLfEOg8iaVwiayPCErgnBeKUTfLzoHbVKyW2k/0?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg" data-cropselx1="0" data-cropselx2="578" data-cropsely1="0" data-cropsely2="710" data-backw="578" data-backh="710" data-imgfileid="504272789" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261020/6ad741c5b618f.png?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section></section><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mr38q9h31fs1" data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><span style="color: #FFFFFF;">雷峰网雷峰网</span></section><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-data-temp-type="historyRecommend" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mr38qm3y1knu" data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><section style="font-size: 16px;white-space: normal;display: flex;color: rgb(224, 98, 43);background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);justify-content: center;align-items: center;user-select: text !important;" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section style="font-size: 12px;line-height: 1.6em;text-align: center;user-select: text !important;" mpa-from-tpl="t"><br/><br/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p style="display: none;"><mp-style-type data-value="3"></mp-style-type></p>]]></description>
